{"timestamp":"2026-10-29T06:13:30.607Z","ordinal":494949,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"agent_message","id":"amsg_01a1864a-c96f-7d21-8926-f98295937912","author":"/root/review_pr300_readiness","recipient":"/root","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Message Type: FINAL_ANSWER\nTask name: /root\nSender: /root/review_pr300_readiness\nPayload:\nEntire Review:\n\n**Scope:** PR #321, `docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md` only; base `6b786d54dd5bf60234c67fec6ef070c62af9b141`, head `524a2dcd4421994e72b98609054b44efaefa1b93`. No files changed and no tests run. No held-out payloads accessed.\n\n**Disposition: CHANGES_REQUIRED**\n\n- **`READINESS.md:13` — “no matrix cell has been run” overstates the evidence.** The current worksheet records a partial operator report: the client rendered at tested sizes, with a resize limitation in tmux. That report lacks the identity and per-cell evidence needed to complete a cell, so **0/15 accepted/evidenced cells** remains accurate. Change the wording to say no cell has a complete, artifact-bound result, and retain the 0/15 status.\n\n- **`READINESS.md:5` — current-main CI status is stale now.** The checkpoint observed at 05:52 UTC accurately said run [40822684551](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40822684551) was in progress then. It completed successfully on the same main SHA at 05:58:56 UTC, with Node 22, Node 24, and Linux x86_64 all passing. Since this is the current checkpoint, update it before merging; the statement that no complete current-main CI pass is claimed no longer reflects live status.\n\nThe remaining reviewed claims align with the checked state: main remains at `6b786d54`; PR #318’s Node jobs failed and Linux was skipped; PR #319’s Linux job was still running; custody remains incomplete and ownership reconciliation unresolved; acceptance remains `IN_PROGRESS`; exact-RC qualification and the mandatory terminal matrix remain outstanding. DEC-18 waives screenshots only, and the documented 5×3 interactive matrix remains required.\n\nDiff SHA-256: `a1be912a33187029beac8acb0983a6b3670030399760f1abd0c7cc150c599df4`\n\n"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a18647-4a32-7a30-bab7-2a3c3cdf19a7","create_time":1793254410.6071658,"content_item_metadata":[{"provenance":{"type":"tool","namespace":"collaboration"}}]}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"user_input_order":23182}}
