ks pass. CodeQL and JavaScript/TypeScript pass, but both Node 22 and Node 24 CI jobs failed: `eval_hardened.test.ts` could not find `go` while testing hidden-source isolation (exit 127). The failure is a CI toolchain-provisioning gap; it is not evidence that the corpus evaluator passed. Entire Gates also failed, and Linux packaging was skipped after the matrix failure. SageBridge has a separate workflow-only candidate at `d53caea7c480c5e88dff43c6e5d4cb8a16868400` to provision the toolchains; its independent review and push are pending. PR [#319](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/319), head `668721d8135d3a3332bca27b820caa5a4a76c7af` on the same base, has independent source-review `ACCEPT`; Node 22/24, CodeQL, and JavaScript/TypeScript pass, while Linux packaging/tests and Entire Gates remain pending. Neither PR is merged.\n+**Open source changes:** PR [#318](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/318), head `2c532d701c5b84b0d3308b02897520337addc36b`, has independent `ACCEPT` source review, but both Node 22 and Node 24 CI jobs failed because `eval_hardened.test.ts` could not find `go` while testing hidden-source isolation (exit 127); Linux was skipped. This is a CI toolchain-provisioning gap, not evaluator qualification evidence. PR [#322](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/322), head `d53caea7c480c5e88dff43c6e5d4cb8a16868400`, adds CI-only pinned Go/Rust toolchain provisioning and has independent `ACCEPT` review; setup succeeded, but its Node 22/24 CLI suites are still running. PR [#319](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/319), head `668721d8135d3a3332bca27b820caa5a4a76c7af`, and PR [#320](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/320), head `2124538d21b84454319c5485140b266f11510a5a`, both have independent `ACCEPT` reviews and passing Node 22/24, JS/TS, and CodeQL checks; Linux and Entire Gates remain in progress. PR [#321](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/321), head `524a2dcd4421994e72b98609