omplete independent custody acceptance; terminal operator evidence is still required before independent RC acceptance.\n \n ## Historical checkpoint (observed 2026-10-29 04:23 UTC; superseded)\n \n","exit_code":0,"duration":{"secs":0,"nanos":808977024}},"started_at_ms":1793254722366,"completed_at_ms":1793254723176}}
