{"timestamp":"2026-10-29T06:20:35.650Z","ordinal":495292,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a181ab-bb8d-7471-bcfe-7451f754e731","turn_id":"01a18647-4a32-7a30-bab7-2a3c3cdf19a7","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-d6139148-ad94-4b2d-911f-87f0d29f4018","process_id":"36312","command":["/usr/bin/zsh","-lc","git show origin/main:AGENTS.md | sed -n '1,100p'; printf '\\n-- claim candidates --\\n'; find .git/nexus-claims -maxdepth 2 -type f -name owner.json -print 2>/dev/null | sort | while read f; do case \"$f\" in *AGENT*) echo \"$f\"; cat \"$f\";; esac; done; printf '\\n-- current main version dirs --\\n'; git worktree list --porcelain | head -100"],"cwd":"file:///home/mike/nexus-code","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"unknown","cmd":"git show origin/main:AGENTS.md | sed -n '1,100p'; printf '\\n-- claim candidates --\\n'; find .git/nexus-claims -maxdepth 2 -type f -name owner.json -print 2>/dev/null | sort | while read f; do case \"$f\" in *AGENT*) echo \"$f\"; cat \"$f\";; esac; done; printf '\\n-- current main version dirs --\\n'; git worktree list --porcelain | head -100"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","aggregated_output":"# Project Guidelines & Agent Instructions\n\n## Commands\n- Build: `make build` or `cargo build` or `npm run build`\n- Test: `make test` or `cargo test` or `npm test`\n- Lint: `cargo clippy` or `npm run lint`\n\n## Code Conventions\n- Maintain documentation integrity and keep existing comments.\n- Always run tests after making changes to verify correctness.\n- Keep functions modular and clearly typed.\n\n## Entire CLI\n- Set `ENTIRE_TOKEN_STORE=file` in the environment before running any `entire` command (for example, `export ENTIRE_TOKEN_STORE=file`).\n\n## v1.0.0 work and concurrent agents\n- The v1.0.0 plan is in `docs/v1.0.0/` (start at `docs/v1.0.0/README.md`). Implement one claimed PR slice at a time, within the safe change boundary in its plan.\n- When more than one agent may be working, follow `docs/v1.0.0/CONCURRENCY.md`. In short:\n  - Claim the slice atomically under `$(git rev-parse --git-common-dir)/nexus-claims/`.\n  - Use one worktree and branch per slice; never edit `~/nexus-code` directly.\n  - Isolate `HOME` for every test or probe run.\n  - Claim hot files before editing them.\n  - Take the `GATEWAY` claim for any inference run.\n  - Never use `pkill -f`.\n  - Check `git log` for foreign commits before every commit.\n  - Leave push, tag and publish to the owner.\n\n-- claim candidates --\n\n-- current main version dirs --\nworktree /home/mike/nexus-code\nHEAD 31303130761ea23027800c993c7e17291e2a2d3f\nbranch refs/heads/main\n\nworktree /home/mike/df/wt/t1\nHEAD 2860228cb84166d0295961587ad4934184165bd0\nbranch refs/heads/dogfood/c1-t1\n\nworktree /home/mike/df/wt/t2\nHEAD 2860228cb84166d0295961587ad4934184165bd0\nbranch refs/heads/dogfood/c1-t2\n\nworktree /home/mike/df/wt/t3\nHEAD 2860228cb84166d0295961587ad4934184165bd0\nbranch refs/heads/dogfood/c1-t3\n\nworktree /home/mike/df/wt/t4\nHEAD 2860228cb84166d0295961587ad4934184165bd0\nbranch refs/heads/dogfood/c1-t4\n\nworktree /home/mike/df/wt/t5\nHEAD 2860228cb84166d0295961587ad4934184165bd0\nbranch refs/heads/dogfood/c1-t5\n\nworktree /home/mike/df2/c2exp/rg_6845415\nHEAD 6f710430e94297cfc2886216404a5bd510e5568e\ndetached\n\nworktree /home/mike/df2/c2exp/rg_6b34f5f\nHEAD 6845415a3c647ad375bec508f509e2b031ee2a88\ndetached\n\nworktree /home/mike/df2/c2exp/rg_6f71043\nHEAD 1b71e27af194356b4ede4f4fc53b7acaf8121c94\ndetached\n\nworktree /home/mike/df2/c2exp/wt/w1_r1_control\nHEAD 2860228cb84166d0295961587ad4934184165bd0\ndetached\n\nworktree /home/mike/df2/c2exp/wt/w1_r2_c2\nHEAD 2860228cb84166d0295961587ad4934184165bd0\ndetached\n\nworktree /home/mike/df2/c2exp/wt/w1_r3_c2\nHEAD 2860228cb84166d0295961587ad4934184165bd0\ndetached\n\nworktree /home/mike/df2/c2exp/wt/w1_r4_control\nHEAD 2860228cb84166d0295961587ad4934184165bd0\ndetached\n\nworktree /home/mike/df2/c2exp/wt/w1_r5_control\nHEAD 28