=PASS independent_review=ACCEPT diff_sha256=61d3123133336b3588f84a7bdba264918c4b9c1e351de0dbf89ff292d368bdce merge_actor_verified; main_CI_40828157972_and_CodeQL_40828157982_started\n2026-10-29T06:16:00Z PR321_READINESS_CORRECTION head=13744504c2f6bf317f36ee0d59ce675b9014a8f6 review_previous=CHANGES_REQUIRED two_findings_corrected diff_check=PASS exact_head_CI=restarted independent_review=pending by=codex-root\n2026-10-29T06:17:03Z POST_MERGE_POLL main=a0356c4d8f0f0b9b943d4033aff59795fcab83b4 main_CI=40828157972_IN_PROGRESS CodeQL=40828157982_IN_PROGRESS; PR320 Node22_Node24_PASS Linux=IN_PROGRESS; PR321 Node22_Node24_JS_TS=IN_PROGRESS; PR322 Node22_Node24_PASS Linux=IN_PROGRESS; no other required check failures; custody response still absent\n2026-10-29T06:19:24Z PR321_READINESS_REBASED head=84e6bb7ce9e2ba3cc287db5a40119937870c51d4 base=a0356c4d8f0f0b9b943d4033aff59795fcab83b4 PR319_integrated=a0356c4d requirements_pass version_rc10 CI_main_post_merge=RUNNING independent_review=pending exact_checks=queued by=codex-root\\n\n2026-10-29T06:20:00Z | PR321 independent review refreshed | reviewer rc1_docs_review ACCEPT on exact base 6b786d54dd5bf60234c67fec6ef070c62af9b141 to head 13744504c2f6bf317f36ee0d59ce675b9014a8f6, diff SHA256 a131f101e58fb0cdeb7f5715043956e2d0756ecdd65fa89ac82b81e853b5e58c. Read-only, no tests. The timestamped 06:14 checkpoint is explicitly partial and preserves 0/15 terminal results.\n2026-10-29T06:20:00Z AGENT_MAIL_CONTACT_REQUEST from=BlackBarn to=SageBridge project=/home/mike/nexus-code expires_in=48h task=metadata_only_custody_owner_confirmation_or_safe_handoff; no_payload_or_private_digest_access\n2026-10-29T06:20:38Z CI_PROGRESS PR320_node22_node24=PASS_linux=IN_PROGRESS; PR321_node22_node24=IN_PROGRESS; PR322_node22_node24=PASS_linux=IN_PROGRESS; REDACTED; SageBridge_contact_request=sent_via_AgentMail_as_BlackBarn_no_auth_token_for_inbox\n\n2026-10-29T06:22:00Z | PR321 refresh | owner rebased/refreshed PR321 onto merged main a0356c4d; cur