le conversation checkpoints. PR #307's build-identity change is present on this main revision.\n781:- **Requirements and version checks:** On a clean detached worktree at exactly `8580c82`, `node scripts/check_requirements.mjs --enforce` passed: 123 rows; tested 108, partial 6, implemented 2, open 7. The 12 listed rows remain deferred to exact-RC qualification. `node scripts/sync-version.mjs --check` passed with all components at `1.0.0-rc.10`.\n"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a18651-eaeb-77d3-9068-c0816219322f","create_time":1793255501.9880512}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
