{"timestamp":"2026-10-29T06:39:41.077Z","ordinal":496095,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"agent_message","id":"amsg_01a18662-c015-7e41-bf34-0eae964bcf58","author":"/root/review_pr300_readiness","recipient":"/root","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Message Type: FINAL_ANSWER\nTask name: /root\nSender: /root/review_pr300_readiness\nPayload:\n**ACCEPT** — Reviewed local candidate `cf843f2778cbec1ef7e65dfa34a6fa3c562a785a` against base `91e394900ee8a9b7c813866c54543abc1f7dd74c`. The diff changes only `docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md`.\n\nThe checkpoint’s main CI and CodeQL runs are bound to exact main `91e39490`; at its 06:38 UTC observation, Node 22/24 were running and CodeQL had passed. On a clean worktree at that exact main, requirements enforcement and version synchronization passed: 12 requirements remain deferred, and the version is `1.0.0-rc.10`.\n\nPR #320’s merge and checks are accurate. PR #322 remains in Linux validation; PR #318’s Node failures and skipped Linux job are accurately described. PR #321 on GitHub is still the old head `84e6bb7` on base `a0356c4`; the new candidate’s exact-head checks are therefore still pending.\n\nThe RC8 identity fix is on current main, while RC10 lacks the new explicit runtime-identity guard, skill-activation prefix, and regression test. RC10 does contain the older generic “You are Nexus Code” prompt; the checkpoint’s “this instruction” correctly refers to the new fix. The SSH preflight versions and RC10 binary identity/hash match the host. The matrix remains 0/15 accepted, and the preflight is not presented as qualification. Custody remains unresolved at 20/40 with no acceptance; acceptance remains `IN_PROGRESS`.\n\nNo suites or held-out payloads were accessed. Diff SHA-256: `REDACTED`\n\n"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a18651-eaeb-77d3-9068-c0816219322f","create_time":1793255981.0775409,"content_item_metadata":[{"provenance":{"type":"tool","namespace":"collaboration"}}]}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"user_input_order":23217}}
