ng main CI completion time; exact cumulative independent review ACCEPT, SHA256 6c25ef45401a48dc56551c90741811b9a05c371698420dc9143924383040fadf. Owner claim is active; do not touch or push., current_main_gate=Exact origin/main 6b786d54dd5bf60234c67fec6ef070c62af9b141 verified 2026-10-29: CI run 40822684551 SUCCESS for Node22, Node24, linux-x86_64; source requirements enforcement exit 0 with 123 rows and 12 exact-RC deferrals; sync-version check confirms rc.10., status=NEXUS_V1_CONVERGENCE_ACTIVE, ci_observation=Verified live handle 40770466028: main Linux test step finished successfully (job is now on package-linux.sh); Node22/24 succeeded. PR310 run 40775615742 on exact remote head 5afbae0e remains Node22/24 in progress; JS/TS, CodeQL passed; Entire pending., suite_claim=Repolled 2026-10-28 23:40 UTC: full CLI suite 2610877 remains live and advanced from team_convergence to test/tui_approval_input_e2e.test.ts. Candidate diff unchanged. Main CI/CodeQL remain green., review_policy=User confirmed single-user repository; do not require another human GitHub account. Non-implementing agent review is the independent source-review path. This does not replace independent exact-RC acceptance., pr310_review_hash=Resolved: plan05_readonly_review confirms ACCEPT covers cumulative PR content at b9a23d51, including b035e716 and b9a23d51. Initial 3f5e1f hash was a working-tree diff including later edits before b9 commit, not the pushed range. Correct base-to-head patch hash for exact pushed PR b9a23d51 is 54bfd6c4bc845df99088ad85f1eef1a8b7181a9e8c29914085972b0fec3839ec; reviewer confirms same content was reviewed., pr310_ci=Completed. PR #310 merged 2026-10-28T22:39:59Z as cbb3b653a6bb6060071d8927e08e30d63765865e. Exact PR head 1f54f2f passed Node22/24, Linux package/repro/SBOM/smoke, JS/TS, CodeQL; Entire Gates concluded NEUTRAL., readiness_worktree=Local readiness branch has additional unpushed commit bf3965543431061d4c119940edab29ab4ee9d473, updating readiness text with completed Node22/24 and remaining Linux test. It is one commit ahead of remote PR head b9a23d51. Preserve; do not force push; exact head requires owner-authorized push and fresh PR checks., pr310_checks=No missing Linux job defect: exact base workflow `.github/workflows/ci.yml` declares `linux-x86_64` with `needs: [test-matrix]`. PR #310’s Node22/24 jobs must finish before Linux is created. Current remote head b9a23d has Node22/24 still running; Linux absence is expected sequencing, not a skip. Ruleset 25340146 requires Node22, Node24 and Linux. Local owner head bf39655 is unpushed; independent reviewer says hosted checks at b9a23 do not cover it., entire_trail23=Independent read-only verification from authenticated `ubuntu-desktop` session over SSH at 2026-10-28 21:55 UTC: `entire trail show 23 --json` reports trail status open, Nexus Code change status merged, hasCodeChanges=false, isPossiblyPartial=true. `entire trail approvals 23` and `entire trail finding list --trail 23 --status any --include-dismissed --json` both report no open changes in selected repository, so the historic high-severity finding and approval details remain unavailable. No finding resolution is inferred. This supports the cautious wording in PR310; no credentials or protected corpus content read., rc_process=Verified from `.github/workflows/release.yml` and `scripts/sync-version.mjs` at exact current source 10c84df: root package.json is version source; sync-version updates CLI and Rust package/lock files. Tag workflow requires tag on main, tag/version match, and docs/releases/<tag>.md; it runs tests/security, deterministic double Linux package plus checksum/notices/SBOM/installer comparisons and smoke, attests archive/checksum, then publishes RC tags as prereleases. Stable tag must be a version-only child of matching RC; workflow creates stable GitHub release as draft, which is made public with `gh release edit <tag> --draft=false` after signed acceptance. Current version is 1.0.0-rc.10. Do not tag