concurrently. PR CodeQL and JS/TS pass. Entire Gates failed but is not ruleset-required., terminal_screenshot_waiver=User explicitly waives screenshots as release artifacts on 2026-10-28. This does not waive live terminal matrix interactions, exact successor RC binding, dimensions, per-cell verdicts/observations, or safety gates., timestamp_followup=Independent reviewer ACCEPTed local branch codex/release-readiness-timestamp commit f56ece220613a86d79f22bcbdb1b234355a39a99 on cbb3b653; branch clean and one commit ahead; push withheld under owner-only boundary., current_main=91e394900ee8a9b7c813866c54543abc1f7dd74c after PR320 merge at 2026-10-29T06:31:22Z; CI 40829723082 and CodeQL 40829723067 started., pr311_ci=Exact PR311 head 4c4df05a32889dae251750780880b6d4d61401eb failed Node22 and Node24, both with the same five operation-view tests treating expected ANSI SGR styling as unsafe controls and one TUI PTY elapsed timer race. JS/TS and CodeQL passed; Linux skipped after failed matrix. Fix draft is present in owned worktree but not yet committed or requalified., owner_action=No user action requested now. Held-out custody issue is awaiting custodian metadata response; no private material accessed. Manual 15-cell real-terminal qualification and installed-RC gates wait for a successor exact RC., pr311_auto_merge=Refreshed at 2026-10-29 00:32Z: PR #311 auto-merge had been re-enabled at 00:21Z despite the exact-head independent CHANGES_REQUIRED review. Disabled again with gh pr merge --disable-auto; confirmed autoMergeRequest=null and posted comment 6484435149. Continue to verify it stays disabled until both findings are fixed, corrected full diff receives independent ACCEPT, and required exact-head checks pass., stale_claim_reconciliation=Archived own stale SEC_CODEQL_EVAL_TEST_SCRIPT_ARGS_20261026 claim as superseded, preserving branch/worktree and audit record. PR252 is merged, PR311 CodeQL passes, and GitHub code-scanning API returned zero open alerts., terminal_preflight=Fresh SSH to ubuntu-desktop 10.0.8.3 confirms xterm XTerm(407), kitty 0.45.0, tmux 3.6, GNOME Terminal 3.58.0, VS Code 1.143.1 and active local Wayland seat0. RC10 only installed; matrix still 0/15., rc_tags=Current remote tags/releases refreshed 2026-10-28: latest published candidate is v1.0.0-rc.10 at tag commit 0e99eeb7268ec798d4859f01279c9db8b1ce42f6, peeled source 16ee8ca3643824741b6da67936b41f262414fdf0; no rc.11 or stable v1.0.0 exists. Candidate source version check remains rc.10., current_observation=2026-10-29 01:12 UTC: origin/main cbb3b653a6bb6060071d8927e08e30d63765865e and origin/v1/integration 7d6673f108316dda015b858c85b2abe20f3a4f78; shared checkout untouched/dirty. PR311 exact head 0f9da7ce: Node22/24 pass, CodeQL+JS/TS pass, Linux package/test job still at npm test. PR313 exact head 97ad3f4: draft, CI 22/24 test jobs running; independent source ACCEPT and owner-reported 34/34 focused test/build pass. SUITE PID chain 3297921->3310681->3310697 still live on snapshot 03bfaa394c906d900574f35104e521844049403c; active harness-core child observed, no overlapping suite. Acceptance remains IN_PROGRESS., entire_pr311_gate=Exact PR311 head check Entire Gates failed with 3 reported items: no reviewer approved the trail, CI checks have not passed, and candidate is 8 commits behind. The protected branch ruleset requires only Node22, Node24, and linux-x86_64 checks; Entire Gates is not required by the current ruleset. The source candidate has no changed-path overlap with the 8 current-main commits, but needs a current-base update and fresh exact-head qualification., source_divergence=PR311 merge-base is 10c84df89d391987454e4997aaa8f97529cc2496; current main cbb3b653 is 8 commits ahead and candidate 4c4df05a is 24 commits ahead. Changed paths across the two sides are disjoint. Defer merge/update until the active SUITE process finishes., draft_review=Independent reviewer /root/pr311_draft_review returned CHANGES_REQUIRED for diff SHA-256 78701fc73cc9d6d39bb504