{"timestamp":"2026-10-29T06:48:46.843Z","ordinal":496538,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call_output","id":"ctco_01a1866b-13fb-71f3-9103-ca84195db70d","call_id":"call_ca77a9a99a13491c9cc1c73458454535","output":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Script completed\nWall time 6.5 seconds\nOutput:\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"{\"i\":0,\"r\":{\"status\":\"fulfilled\",\"value\":{\"chunk_id\":\"a06a9b\",\"wall_time_seconds\":0.430764303,\"exit_code\":0,\"original_token_count\":1086,\"output\":\"{\\\"agent\\\":\\\"kimi-code\\\",\\\"branch\\\":\\\"v1/qualify-all-accepted-v9\\\",\\\"since\\\":\\\"2026-10-28T23:42:27Z\\\",\\\"pid\\\":2827782,\\\"scope\\\":\\\"held-out corpus compatibility and custody handoff; no payload exposure\\\"}\\n{\\\"body\\\":\\\"Metadata-only coordination follow-up: the last custodian status request was posted at 2026-10-28 12:42 UTC; issue #1 remains unassigned. Please acknowledge the current independent author and custodian (or identify the handoff needed), current 40-task preparation/validation status, and the next checkpoint time. Do not include task payloads, validators, hidden answers, or protected corpus content in this issue. Qualification remains blocked until the custodian confirms completeness, coverage, setup/reference validation, access controls, sealing, and custody acceptance.\\\",\\\"created_at\\\":\\\"2026-10-28T14:23:15Z\\\",\\\"id\\\":6471557295,\\\"user\\\":\\\"mikeholownych\\\"}\\n{\\\"body\\\":\\\"Release-critical metadata follow-up (2026-10-28 20:24 UTC): the 14:23 status request remains unanswered and the issue is still unassigned. Please confirm whether the independent author/custodian is actively preparing the corpus and give the next checkpoint. If that owner is unavailable, identify the authorized custody handoff path so this lane can continue without exposing private material. No task payloads, validators, answers, or private digests are requested. Held-out qualification remains unstarted.\\\",\\\"created_at\\\":\\\"2026-10-28T20:25:33Z\\\",\\\"id\\\":6479873007,\\\"user\\\":\\\"mikeholownych\\\"}\\n{\\\"body\\\":\\\"Release qualification contract clarification (2026-10-28): the current exact-source evaluator intentionally rejects in-process legacy hidden validators for qualification (`eval/validate.mjs` qualification check and `eval/run.mjs` hidden-check path). The evaluator documentation explains that those validators share the candidate runtime/workspace and are not safe for independent qualification; the qualification format is the isolated `blackbox-v1` oracle. This is a security boundary, so coordinator changes will not enable legacy hidden commands to make the existing corpus run.\\\\n\\\\nPlease confirm the custodian-led path to convert the sealed public task manifest to `blackbox-v1` or produce a newly versioned replacement corpus, then perform private validator/reference checks and re-derive custody digests. Public metadata only is needed here: corpus version/manifest identity, compatibility status, owner/checkpoint, and whether this conversion requires new custody acceptance. No private payloads, answers, validators, reference patches, or private digests should be posted. Held-out qualification remains unstarted pending custodian acceptance.\\\\n\\\",\\\"created_at\\\":\\\"2026-10-28T22:23:50Z\\\",\\\"id\\\":6482202709,\\\"user\\\":\\\"mikeholownych\\\"}\\n{\\\"body\\\":\\\"Following up on the public custody status only; no private corpus content or answers are requested. The issue remains open and unassigned, and there has been no custodian update since the previous clarification.\\\\n\\\\nPlease provide either (1) the independent author/custodian’s current status and next checkpoint for the 40-task corpus, or (2) the authorized handoff path if that owner is unavailable. Please do not attach task payloads, hidden solutions, or validator contents here.\\\\n\\\\nT2/T3/T4 qualification remains unstarted until the custodian confirms independent authorship, complete coverage, re-derived private integrity checks, isolated setup/reference validation, effective access boundaries, and sealed-manifest acceptance. The public manifest alone is not custody acceptance.\\\",\\\"created_at\\\":\\\"2026-10-28T23:57:25Z\\\",\\\"id\\\":6483900189,\\\"user\\\":\\\"mikeholownych\\\"}\\n{\\\"body\\\":\\\"Custody checkpoint (2026-10-29 00:47 UTC; metadata only): the designated coordination contact confirms they still hold the held-out custody coordination claim, but cannot access the root-owned T2/T3 stores. No new authoring or private validation progress is claimed; T2 remains incompatible with the qualification runner's isolated blackbox-v1 validator contract, T3 fresh custody acceptance is unverified, and no qualification has started. The coordinator has requested a root-custodian-owned validation or an approved non-disclosing execution path. No private corpus material, validators, answers, credentials, or digests were accessed or posted. The corpus remains sealed pending custodian action.\\\",\\\"created_at\\\":\\\"2026-10-29T00:50:59Z\\\",\\\"id\\\":6484772603,\\\"user\\\":\\\"mikeholownych\\\"}\\n\"}}}"},{"type":"input_text","text":"{\"i\":1,\"r\":{\"status\":\"fulfilled\",\"value\":{\"chunk_id\":\"3fe6f2\",\"wall_time_seconds\":1.986217768,\"exit_code\":0,\"original_token_count\":2581,\"output\":\"{\\\"conclusion\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"headSha\\\":\\\"183158f00a6dcfa92ded6fa54fda6aeb1d833ad1\\\",\\\"jobs\\\":[{\\\"completedAt\\\":\\\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\\\",\\\"conclusion\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"databaseId\\\":123304326268,\\\"name\\\":\\\"test-matrix (22)\\\",\\\"startedAt\\\":\\\"2026-10-29T06:42:13Z\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"in_progress\\\",\\\"steps\\\":[{\\\"completedAt\\\":\\\"2026-10-29T06:42:15Z\\\",\\\"conclusion\\\":\\\"success\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Set up job\\\",\\\"number\\\":1,\\\"startedAt\\\":\\\"2026-10-29T06:42:13Z\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"completed\\\"},{\\\"completedAt\\\":\\\"2026-10-29T06:42:17Z\\\",\\\"conclusion\\\":\\\"suc