{"timestamp":"2026-10-29T07:07:43.627Z","ordinal":497327,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a181ab-bb8d-7471-bcfe-7451f754e731","turn_id":"01a18678-40eb-70b2-b167-11dc8ca1d04f","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-5e720166-5167-4f6d-9946-0f8a3cb21935","process_id":"28287","command":["/usr/bin/zsh","-lc","node --check eval/isolate.mjs && bash -n scripts/install-evaluator-toolchains.sh && git diff --check && node cli/scripts/run_tests.mjs test/eval_integrity.test.ts"],"cwd":"file:///home/mike/nexus-wt/eval-agent-toolchain-binds","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"unknown","cmd":"node --check eval/isolate.mjs && bash -n scripts/install-evaluator-toolchains.sh && git diff --check && node cli/scripts/run_tests.mjs test/eval_integrity.test.ts"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","aggregated_output":"✔ the model proxy forwards requests and counts answers and upstream failures (237.349715ms)\n✔ the evaluation proxy authenticates the local run token and replaces it with the upstream credential (40.685545ms)\n✔ the evaluation proxy bounds request count and body size (27.385473ms)\n✔ the evaluation proxy bounds concurrent inference and cancels upstream work on client abort (65.963212ms)\n✔ the evaluation proxy enforces per-request and aggregate requested completion-token ceilings (56.543723ms)\n✔ the evaluation proxy never forwards the local token when the upstream is unauthenticated (21.761997ms)\n✔ infrastructure reruns use one rule for every agent: a crash after the model answered is scored (142.631398ms)\n✔ contaminated runs leave the pass rate, crashes are counted, and reruns are listed (94.470216ms)\n✔ T4 scoring requires all nine classes and five injected runs per class (1111.142272ms)\n✔ task validation: pinned repos, one source, and black-box hidden oracle for qualification (38.073198ms)\n✔ T4 fixture evidence requires an exact CLI runner receipt and measured storage boundary (2.73757ms)\n✔ black-box oracle keeps canary expectations outside the candidate process and returns sanitized evidence (715.949693ms)\n✔ Python black-box oracle uses only pinned offline Go and Rust toolchains, or fails preflight (30495.509632ms)\n✔ a qualification run is refused without a model fingerprint (weights, server build, sampling) (1.268023ms)\n✔ qualification requires frozen request and aggregate output budgets (0.926568ms)\n✔ hidden tests must be unreadable to the agent's own user (3.346216ms)\n✔ candidate agents receive only the approved read-only Go and Rust toolchain mounts (1.871401ms)\n✔ qualification runtime mounts cannot overlap the task tree, held-out store, or private validator paths (381.92388ms)\n✔ qualification remains fail-closed without enforced aggregate resource controls (6.528718ms)\n✔ resource contract: candidate memory, processes, storage and CPU are kernel-bounded and every process is reaped (21053.976879ms)\n✔ resource supervisor preserves SIGTERM grace for descendants after the main payload exits (2597.891463ms)\n✔ candidate sandbox and resource supervisor compose around a staged repository (3420.315552ms)\n✔ repository workspaces carry no history beyond the pinned baseline commit (1311.510335ms)\n✔ task paths reject traversal, symlink escapes, and unstable task trees (6.395605ms)\n✔ task-tree digests frame paths, entry types, executable mode, and content lengths (22.464813ms)\n✔ task setup and validators run with cleared env, no network, confined filesystem, bounded output and timeout (4528.015821ms)\n✔ candidate namespace reaches only its authenticated run proxy and cannot read host files (659.193452ms)\n✔ qualification corpus binding rejects missing, mismatched, and post-seal task content (7.249272ms)\n✔ run.mjs refuses to start on an invalid task (199.380265ms)\n✔ the model proxy injects each scheduled fault into the chat request it names, and records it (51.920898ms)\n✔ executable probes refuse bind sources that overlap protected corpus material (4.575843ms)\nℹ tests 31\n