 \"name\": \"CodeQL\",\n      \"status\": \"COMPLETED\",\n      \"conclusion\": \"SUCCESS\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": null,\n      \"status\": null,\n      \"conclusion\": null\n    }\n  ],\n  \"comments\": [\n    {\n      \"author\": \"mikeholownych\",\n      \"createdAt\": \"2026-10-29T05:41:01Z\",\n      \"body\": \"### Independent Review Update — `ACTION REQUIRED` (GitHub Actions CI Regression in `cli/test/eval_hardened.test.ts`)\\n\\n- **PR**: #318 (`fix(eval): bind pinned toolchains read-only`)\\n- **Head SHA**: `2c532d701c5b84b0d3308b02897520337addc36b` (and prior head `4e59122b45195c2f0acc10050c27c33454303fef`)\\n- **Failing CI Run**: [`40822678732`](https://gith\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"author\": \"mikeholownych\",\n      \"createdAt\": \"2026-10-29T05:55:55Z\",\n      \"body\": \"The exact #318 Node 22 and Node 24 CI logs each fail one `eval_hardened` test (`Go and Rust hidden sources are absent during build audits and test execution`) because `go` is not available at `/usr/local/go/bin` inside the candidate sandbox. All other Node 22 tests passed (2,023 passed, 1 failed, 2 skipped). The reviewed CI provisioning fix is now \"\n    },\n    {\n      \"author\": \"mikeholownych\",\n      \"createdAt\": \"2026-10-29T06:49:22Z\",\n      \"body\": \"## Independent Review — `07e2d2c63fcd2cded4331c88d3c0c5bfb323a930`\\n\\n- **Disposition**: **ACCEPT**\\n- **Base / Merge Base**: `183158f00a6dcfa92ded6fa54fda6aeb1d833ad1` (`origin/main`, including PR #322 provisioning pinned `/usr/local/go` and `/opt/nexus-qual/rust` toolchains in GitHub Actions)\\n- **Cumulative Diff SHA-256**: `56ab8a3ecef2ada575aacd09e\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"author\": \"mikeholownych\",\n      \"createdAt\": \"2026-10-29T07:04:31Z\",\n      \"body\": \"## Independent Review Update — CI Run `40830935815` on `07e2d2c63fcd2cded4331c88d3c0c5bfb323a930`\\n\\n- **Disposition**: **ACTION REQUIRED** (CI regression on GitHub Actions `test-matrix (22)` and `test-matrix (24)`)\\n- **Head**: `07e2d