{"timestamp":"2026-10-29T07:30:57.717Z","ordinal":498348,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a181ab-bb8d-7471-bcfe-7451f754e731","turn_id":"01a18686-7f9d-7a01-aaee-252d4871c34f","item":{"type":"SubAgentActivity","model":null,"reasoning_effort":null,"id":"subagent-completed-01a1868b-91c7-7c30-a8b5-6f1b2edc7ff1","kind":"completed","agent_thread_id":"01a181c6-b448-7e91-9adc-6dc9bccf575e","agent_path":"/root/review_pr302"},"started_at_ms":1793259057716,"completed_at_ms":1793259057717}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-29T07:30:58.780Z","ordinal":498349,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"function_call_output","id":"fco_01a18691-b65c-7a72-a8e5-0a9450f376b4","call_id":"call_525f2e3c9eb24910a2733aa9f5f705e8","output":"{\"agents\":[{\"agent_name\":\"/root\",\"agent_status\":\"running\"},{\"agent_name\":\"/root/pr311_draft_review\",\"agent_status\":{\"completed\":\"**ACCEPT** — exact four-file diff SHA-256: `56ab8a3ecef2ada575aacd09e3e5148948fb6b013640c92b071d11598a629184`.\\n\\nPinned toolchain roots and their contents are checked for root ownership, canonical paths, and write/symlink safety before use. Candidate and Python oracle mounts are read-only; oracle launches clear the environment, use offline Go/Rust settings and temporary caches, and refuse protected-corpus overlap. The fixtures cover unsafe roots, production launch paths, and Go/Rust execution.\\n\\n**Independence note:** I previously reviewed related evaluator-toolchain and provisioning changes, so this is a fresh review of the exact candidate, but should not be represented as fully independent of those earlier reviews. No tests run.\"}},{\"agent_name\":\"/root/review_pr300_readiness\",\"agent_status\":{\"completed\":\"**CHANGES_REQUIRED** for PR #318.\\n\\nExact diff SHA-256: `56ab8a3ecef2ada575aacd09e3e5148948fb6b013640c92b071d11598a629184`.\\n\\n- Oracle code can bypass the approved compiler paths: the sandbox mounts all of `/usr/bin` read-only, while Python oracle code can execute arbitrary subprocesses. Setting `PATH` to prefer pinned Go/Rust roots does not prevent invoking unapproved compilers by absolute path. The new tests check PATH and mount arguments but do not exercise this escape.\\n- The toolchain versions are not fixed: CI selects Go `1.22.x` and copies whichever Rust sysroot the runner provides, comparing each copy only to its source. Runner image or toolcache updates can silently change the qualification compilers.\\n\\nThe new mounts are read-only and checked for ownership, permissions, and symlinks; oracle caches are placed under `/tmp`, and offline settings are applied. I did not edit files or run tests.\\n\\n\"}},{\"agent_name\":\"/root/review_pr302\",\"agent_status\":\"running\"}]}","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a18686-7f9d-7a01-aaee-252d4871c34f","create_time":1793259058.7802866}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-29T07:30:58.784Z","ordinal":498350,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"token_count","info":{"total_token_usage":{"input_tokens":9207468783,"cached_input_tokens":9109963520,"cache_write_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":25643335,"reasoning_output_tokens":15840847,"total_tokens":9233112118},"last_token_usage":{"input_tokens":180263,"cached_input_tokens":179328,"cache_write_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":47,"reasoning_output_tokens":30,"total_tokens":180310},"model_context_window":258400},"rate_limits":{"limit_id":"codex","limit_name":null,"primary":{"used_percent":99.0,"window_minutes":10080,"resets_at":1793792057},"secondary":null,"credits":{"has_credits":false,"unlimited":false,"balance":"0"},"individual_limit":null,"spend_control_reached":null,"plan_type":"team","rate_limit_reached_type":null}}}
