{"timestamp":"2026-10-29T07:38:51.500Z","ordinal":498679,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a181ab-bb8d-7471-bcfe-7451f754e731","turn_id":"01a18686-7f9d-7a01-aaee-252d4871c34f","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-66697e5d-41a7-42ca-ab7f-4bf4c68419ee","process_id":"1418","command":["/usr/bin/zsh","-lc","node scripts/run_tests.mjs test/eval_integrity.test.ts"],"cwd":"file:///home/mike/nexus-wt/eval-agent-toolchain-binds/cli","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"unknown","cmd":"node scripts/run_tests.mjs test/eval_integrity.test.ts"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","aggregated_output":"✔ the model proxy forwards requests and counts answers and upstream failures (226.11894ms)\n✔ the evaluation proxy authenticates the local run token and replaces it with the upstream credential (42.557498ms)\n✔ the evaluation proxy bounds request count and body size (30.185892ms)\n✔ the evaluation proxy bounds concurrent inference and cancels upstream work on client abort (67.599926ms)\n✔ the evaluation proxy enforces per-request and aggregate requested completion-token ceilings (42.873911ms)\n✔ the evaluation proxy never forwards the local token when the upstream is unauthenticated (17.394139ms)\n✔ infrastructure reruns use one rule for every agent: a crash after the model answered is scored (150.290938ms)\n✔ contaminated runs leave the pass rate, crashes are counted, and reruns are listed (82.442554ms)\n✔ T4 scoring requires all nine classes and five injected runs per class (692.848396ms)\n✔ task validation: pinned repos, one source, and black-box hidden oracle for qualification (40.566997ms)\n✔ T4 fixture evidence requires an exact CLI runner receipt and measured storage boundary (3.375241ms)\n✔ black-box oracle keeps canary expectations outside the candidate process and returns sanitized evidence (444.04477ms)\n✔ Python black-box oracle uses only pinned offline Go and Rust toolchains, or fails preflight (4036.829672ms)\n✔ a qualification run is refused without a model fingerprint (weights, server build, sampling) (1.130421ms)\n✔ qualification requires frozen request and aggregate output budgets (0.868718ms)\n✔ hidden tests must be unreadable to the agent's own user (2.099085ms)\n✔ candidate agents receive only the approved read-only Go and Rust toolchain mounts (0.955352ms)\n✔ qualification runtime mounts cannot overlap the task tree, held-out store, or private validator paths (123.684524ms)\n✔ qualification remains fail-closed without enforced aggregate resource controls (6.875974ms)\n✔ resource contract: candidate memory, processes, storage and CPU are kernel-bounded and every process is reaped (20734.947126ms)\n✔ resource supervisor preserves SIGTERM grace for descendants after the main payload exits (2577.81958ms)\n✔ candidate sandbox and resource supervisor compose around a staged repository (3453.918388ms)\n✔ repository workspaces carry no history beyond the pinned baseline commit (2039.126043ms)\n✔ task paths reject traversal, symlink escapes, and unstable task trees (6.419747ms)\n✔ task-tree digests frame paths, entry types, executable mode, and content lengths (23.644327ms)\n✔ task setup and validators run with cleared env, no network, confined filesystem, bounded output and timeout (4792.209099ms)\n✔ candidate namespace cannot read host files or bypass pinned compilers with absolute paths (418.135413ms)\n✔ qualification corpus binding rejects missing, mismatched, and post-seal task content (80.613542ms)\n✔ run.mjs refuses to start on an invalid task (224.090252ms)\n✔ the model proxy injects each scheduled fault into the chat request it names, and records it (57.906773ms)\n✔ executable probes refuse bind sources that overlap protected corpus material (7.799711ms)\nℹ tests 31\nℹ suites 0\nℹ pass 31\nℹ fail 0\nℹ cancelled 0\nℹ skipped 0\nℹ todo 0\nℹ duration_ms 41165.908229\n","exit_code":0,"duration":{"secs":42,"nanos":389831951}},"started_at_ms":1793259489108,"completed_at_ms":17932595