{"timestamp":"2026-10-29T11:37:08.148Z","ordinal":498783,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_0db389702a7164cc016ae32fda4214819fac092e42f613902d","status":"completed","call_id":"call_950e76a033ef44e6ba04fe3367479197","name":"exec","input":"const patch = \"*** Begin Patch\\n*** Update File: /home/mike/nexus-code/.git/nexus-claims/FILE_eval_isolate.mjs/owner.json\\n@@\\n-  \\\"validation_status\\\": \\\"Exact candidate diff-check PASS; independent review ACCEPT on exact diff hash 008ca7e8db831b41083c4456db7afe55e043f9e8adbc0399f56cfd1fbf671cfb. Hosted exact-head CI 40835609475 remains active in Node22/24 full CLI tests; requirements, build, Rust tests, and pinned toolchain provisioning completed successfully. CodeQL 40835609636 SUCCESS. Held-out access/use: none.\\\",\\n-  \\\"last_updated\\\": \\\"2026-10-29T07:34:12Z\\\",\\n-  \\\"head\\\": \\\"f43f4e5e48947370fc03e1d0ac44a51ecd310849\\\",\\n-  \\\"review\\\": \\\"ACCEPT by independent read-only reviewer /root/plan05_readonly_review on exact base df288ef010a93c418e4972d3d40dc293ec9c0081 and HEAD 95f345f67b583ce0f21a9c774c30401cfc577740; diff SHA-256 008ca7e8db831b41083c4456db7afe55e043f9e8adbc0399f56cfd1fbf671cfb. Candidate commit f43f4e5e has the identical base-to-head diff hash.\\\",\\n-  \\\"status\\\": \\\"PR #318 exact head f43f4e5e48947370fc03e1d0ac44a51ecd310849 on base df288ef010a93c418e4972d3d40dc293ec9c0081; exact base-to-head diff SHA-256 008ca7e8db831b41083c4456db7afe55e043f9e8adbc0399f56cfd1fbf671cfb matches independent ACCEPT. Hosted CI 40835609475: Node 22 and 24 still running full CLI tests; prerequisite pinned toolchain setup, requirements gate, CLI build, and Rust tests pass. CodeQL 40835609636 SUCCESS. No held-out tasks or payloads used; no local SUITE active.\\\"\\n+  \\\"validation_status\\\": \\\"Exact PR candidate 493bffde local eval_integrity test passed 31/31 under isolated HOME; candidate absolute /usr/bin compiler attempts and synthetic exposure fixture passed; diff check passed. Exact-head hosted CI 40866715565 and JS/TS 40866715198 are pending. Held-out access/use: none.\\\",\\n+  \\\"last_updated\\\": \\\"2026-10-29T11:36:51Z\\\",\\n+  \\\"head\\\": \\\"493bffde3c961c36631d644f0e25dca834702712\\\",\\n+  \\\"review\\\": \\\"Previous PR head f43f4e5e received CHANGES_REQUIRED from review_pr302 (diff 008ca7e8); its absolute compiler path bypass is addressed in 493bffde. Fresh independent review of the exact 493bffde diff 5664180286129a192258ce2e18816107a6d6b6285aedda1decd1c4866bd98619 is pending.\\\",\\n+  \\\"status\\\": \\\"PR #318 exact head 493bffde3c961c36631d644f0e25dca834702712 on base df288ef010a93c418e4972d3d40dc293ec9c0081, cumulative diff SHA-256 5664180286129a192258ce2e18816107a6d6b6285aedda1decd1c4866bd98619. Local eval_integrity=31/31 PASS; candidate absolute compiler attempts passed. Exact-head GitHub checks pending and fresh independent review pending. No held-out tasks or payloads used.\\\"\\n }\\n*** Update File: /home/mike/nexus-code/.git/nexus-claims/FILE_cli_test_eval_integrity.test.ts/owner.json\\n@@\\n-  \\\"head\\\": \\\"f43f4e5e48947370fc03e1d0ac44a51ecd310849\\\",\\n-  \\\"status\\\": \\\"PR #318 exact head f43f4e5e48947370fc03e1d0ac44a51ecd310849 on base df288ef010a93c418e4972d3d40dc293ec9c0081; exact base-to-head diff SHA-256 008ca7e8db831b41083c4456db7afe55e043f9e8adbc0399f56cfd1fbf671cfb matches independent ACCEPT. Hosted CI 40835609475: Node 22 and 24 still running full CLI tests; prerequisite pinned toolchain setup, requirements gate, CLI build, and Rust tests pass. CodeQL 40835609636 SUCCESS. No held-out tasks or payloads used; no local SUITE active.\\\",\\n-  \\\"last_updated\\\": \\\"2026-10-29T07:34:12Z\\\",\\n-  \\\"validation_status\\\": \\\"Exact candidate diff-check PASS; independent review ACCEPT on exact diff hash 008ca7e8db831b41083c4456db7afe55e043f9e8adbc0399f56cfd1fbf671cfb. Hosted exact-head CI 40835609475 remains active in Node22/24 full CLI tests; requirements, build, Rust tests, and pinned toolchain provisioning completed successfully. CodeQL 40835609636 SUCCESS. Held-out access/use: none.\\\",\\n-  \\\"review\\\": \\\"ACCEPT by independent read-only reviewer /root/plan05_readonly_review on exact base df288ef010a93c418e4972d3d40dc293ec9c0081 and HEAD 95f345f67b583ce0f21a9c774c30401cfc577740; diff SHA-256 008ca7e8db831b41083c4456db7afe55e043f9e8adbc0399f56cfd1fbf671cfb. Candidate commit f43f4e5e has the identical base-to-head diff hash.\\\"\\n+  \\\"head\\\": \\\"493bffde3c961c36631d644f0e25dca834702712\\\",\\n+  \\\"status\\\": \\\"PR #318 exact head 493bffde3c961c36631d644f0e25dca834702712 on base df288ef010a93c418e4972d3d40dc293ec9c0081; candidate absolute compiler-path prevention committed and pushed. Local focused eval_integrity passed 31/31; exact-head CI and fresh independent review pending. No held-out tasks or payloads used.\\\",\\n+  \\\"last_updated\\\": \\\"2026-10-29T11:36:51Z\\\",\\n+  \\\"validation_status\\\": \\\"Local eval_integrity 31/31 PASS under isolated HOME, including candidate-process absolute compiler probes. Exact-head GitHub checks pending; fresh independent review pending.\\\",\\n+  \\\"review\\\": \\\"Previous head f43f4e5e was CHANGES_REQUIRED by review_pr302; remediation is head 493bffde, whose review is pending.\\\"\\n }\\n*** End Patch\";\ntext(await tools.apply_patch(patch));\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a18771-cd08-7c60-9b2e-7bad123756d6","create_time":1793273818.2634125}}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-29T11:37:08.204Z","ordinal":498784,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a181ab-bb8d-7471-bcfe-7451f754e731","turn_id":"01a18771-cd08-7c60-9b2e-7bad123756d6","item":{"type":"FileChange","id":"exec-68dfa36d-4bad-454a-9055-e781e12c9a9e","changes":{"/home/mike/nexus-code/.git/nexus-claims/FILE_eval_isolate.mjs/owner.json":{"type":"update","unified_diff":"@@ -10,7 +10,7 @@\n   \"scope\": \"PR #318 remediation of independent-review P1: prevent candidate task processes from reaching unpinned Go/Rust compilers through absolute system paths; preserve existing toolchain work; synthetic fixtures only; no held-out qualification task use; no changes outside this worktree\",\n-  \"validation_status\": \"Exact candidate diff-check PASS; independent review ACCEPT on exact diff hash 008ca7e8db831b41083c4456db7afe55e043f9e8adbc0399f56cfd1fbf671cfb. Hosted exact-head CI 40835609475 remains active in Node22/24 full CLI tests; requirements, build, Rust tests, and pinned toolchain provisioning completed successfully. CodeQL 40835609636 SUCCESS. Held-out access/use: none.\",\n-  \"last_updated\": \"2026-10-29T07:34:12Z\",\n-  \"head\": \"f43f4e5e48947370fc03e1d0ac44a51ecd310849\",\n-  \"review\": \"ACCEPT by independent read-only reviewer /root/plan05_readonly_review on exact base df288ef010a93c418e4972d3d40dc293ec9c0081 and HEAD 95f345f67b583ce0f21a9c774c30401cfc577740; diff SHA-256 008ca7e8db831b41083c4456db7afe55e043f9e8adbc0399f56cfd1fbf671cfb. Candidate commit f43f4e5e has the identical base-to-head diff hash.\",\n-  \"status\": \"PR #318 exact head f43f4e5e48947370fc03e1d0ac44a51ecd310849 on base df288ef010a93c418e4972d3d40dc293ec9c0081; exact base-to-head diff SHA-256 008ca7e8db831b41083c4456db7afe55e043f9e8adbc0399f56cfd1fbf671cfb matches independent ACCEPT. Hosted CI 40835609475: Node 22 and 24 still running full CLI tests; prerequisite pinned toolchain setup, requirements gate, CLI build, and Rust tests pass. CodeQL 408356096