I tests; prerequisite pinned toolchain setup, requirements gate, CLI build, and Rust tests pass. CodeQL 40835609636 SUCCESS. No held-out tasks or payloads used; no local SUITE active.\",\n-  \"last_updated\": \"2026-10-29T07:34:12Z\",\n-  \"validation_status\": \"Exact candidate diff-check PASS; independent review ACCEPT on exact diff hash 008ca7e8db831b41083c4456db7afe55e043f9e8adbc0399f56cfd1fbf671cfb. Hosted exact-head CI 40835609475 remains active in Node22/24 full CLI tests; requirements, build, Rust tests, and pinned toolchain provisioning completed successfully. CodeQL 40835609636 SUCCESS. Held-out access/use: none.\",\n-  \"review\": \"ACCEPT by independent read-only reviewer /root/plan05_readonly_review on exact base df288ef010a93c418e4972d3d40dc293ec9c0081 and HEAD 95f345f67b583ce0f21a9c774c30401cfc577740; diff SHA-256 008ca7e8db831b41083c4456db7afe55e043f9e8adbc0399f56cfd1fbf671cfb. Candidate commit f43f4e5e has the identical base-to-head diff hash.\"\n+  \"head\": \"493bffde3c961c36631d644f0e25dca834702712\",\n+  \"status\": \"PR #318 exact head 493bffde3c961c36631d644f0e25dca834702712 on base df288ef010a93c418e4972d3d40dc293ec9c0081; candidate absolute compiler-path prevention committed and pushed. Local focused eval_integrity passed 31/31; exact-head CI and fresh independent review pending. No held-out tasks or payloads used.\",\n+  \"last_updated\": \"2026-10-29T11:36:51Z\",\n+  \"validation_status\": \"Local eval_integrity 31/31 PASS under isolated HOME, including candidate-process absolute compiler probes. Exact-head GitHub checks pending; fresh independent review pending.\",\n+  \"review\": \"Previous head f43f4e5e was CHANGES_REQUIRED by review_pr302; remediation is head 493bffde, whose review is pending.\"\n }\n","move_path":null}},"status":"completed","stdout":"Success. Updated the following files:\nM /home/mike/nexus-code/.git/nexus-claims/FILE_eval_isolate.mjs/owner.json\nM /home/mike/nexus-code/.git/nexus-claims/FILE_cli_test_eval_integrity.t