idate only. It does not tag, build, publish or qualify an\\nartifact; the manual terminal matrix, installed-RC gates, held-out task quality\\nand independent acceptance remain outstanding for this candidate.\",\"messageHeadline\":\"release: cut the 1.0.0-rc.11 candidate\",\"oid\":\"e13da84ff320ca85fb0efacdd6b3f5a5299287fd\"},{\"authoredDate\":\"2026-10-29T11:38:31Z\",\"authors\":[{\"email\":\"mike@holownych.com\",\"id\":\"MDQ6VXNlcjc3NTE3ODA=\",\"login\":\"mikeholownych\",\"name\":\"Mike Holownych\"}],\"committedDate\":\"2026-10-29T11:38:31Z\",\"messageBody\":\"The notes omitted post-RC10 credential-origin and credential-store hardening,\\nworktree/upgrade state recovery, the update_plan workspace fix and Python\\nverifier import ambiguity rejection. Add them so upgraders from rc.10 see the\\nsecurity-relevant changes.\",\"messageHeadline\":\"docs(release): include credential and recovery fixes in the rc.11 notes\",\"oid\":\"ea7b728c70ba05d7ff106c14c0adffd99e6012a5\"}],\"headRefOid\":\"ea7b728c70ba05d7ff106c14c0adffd99e6012a5\",\"mergeStateStatus\":\"BLOCKED\"}\n{\"name\":\"test-matrix (22)\",\"status\":\"in_progress\",\"steps\":[{\"conclusion\":\"\",\"name\":\"Run cargo build --locked --release --manifest-path core/Cargo.toml --bin harness-core --bin nexus-tui\",\"status\":\"in_progress\"}]}\n{\"name\":\"test-matrix (24)\",\"status\":\"in_progress\",\"steps\":[{\"conclusion\":\"\",\"name\":\"Run cargo build --locked --release --manifest-path core/Cargo.toml --bin harness-core --bin nexus-tui\",\"status\":\"in_progress\"}]}\n{\"agent\":\"KimiCode-defect-scan\",\"host\":\"mike-dev\",\"branch\":\"v1/rc11-candidate-20261029\",\"worktree\":\"/home/mike/nexus-wt/rc11-candidate\",\"base\":\"df288ef0\",\"since\":\"2026-10-29T11:33:36Z\",\"pid\":2184488,\"scope\":\"Version-only 1.0.0-rc.11 candidate: version bump and release notes; no tag or publication.\"}\n","exit_code":0,"duration":{"secs":2,"nanos":236979260}},"started_at_ms":1793273966926,"completed_at_ms":179327396916