{"timestamp":"2026-10-29T11:57:11.668Z","ordinal":499417,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a181ab-bb8d-7471-bcfe-7451f754e731","turn_id":"01a18771-cd08-7c60-9b2e-7bad123756d6","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-18a4d190-00ed-4fe0-bc37-0300862a7746","process_id":"55592","command":["/usr/bin/zsh","-lc","gh pr view 316 --json number,title,state,headRefOid,baseRefOid,mergeStateStatus,body,reviews,url && gh pr checks 316"],"cwd":"file:///home/mike/nexus-code","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"unknown","cmd":"gh pr view 316 --json number,title,state,headRefOid,baseRefOid,mergeStateStatus,body,reviews,url && gh pr checks 316"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","aggregated_output":"{\"baseRefOid\":\"b10a85ad6305a4a3564a81d9bc66e88f55036c8d\",\"body\":\"<!-- entire-trail-link-start -->\\nhttps://entire.com/gh/mikeholownych/-/trails/31/changes/nexus-code/31\\n<!-- entire-trail-link-end -->\\n\\n## Summary\\n\\n- Restore the mandatory 15-cell manual real-terminal matrix across five environments and three sizes.\\n- Withdraw DEC-19's prior matrix waiver while preserving its history and anchor.\\n- Clarify that DEC-18 waives screenshot artifacts only; automated PTY checks do not substitute for operator evidence.\\n- Keep custody status explicit: active setup/reference/oracle revalidation is not custody acceptance or held-out qualification.\\n\\n## Exact revision\\n\\n- Base: `b10a85ad6305a4a3564a81d9bc66e88f55036c8d`\\n- Current head: `6348558315de7f52f23fd5a0c3dc317d676030dd`\\n- The manual matrix remains 0/15 accepted cells. `ubuntu-desktop` has the five required terminal applications; operator execution on the exact installed candidate and per-cell evidence remain required.\\n- A partial RC10 operator report says the UI rendered at tested sizes except tmux-in-GNOME-Terminal could not be resized below 43×13. Test time, installed artifact identity, terminal versions, and per-cell checks were not supplied, so this does not fi