{"timestamp":"2026-10-29T12:04:14.371Z","ordinal":499762,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a181ab-bb8d-7471-bcfe-7451f754e731","turn_id":"01a18771-cd08-7c60-9b2e-7bad123756d6","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-72214878-5402-45ec-909f-51603776c947","process_id":"78631","command":["/usr/bin/zsh","-lc","TASK_HOME=$(mktemp -d /var/tmp/nexus-pr318-mask-home.XXXXXX); HOME=\"$TASK_HOME\" XDG_CONFIG_HOME=\"$TASK_HOME/.config\" node scripts/run_tests.mjs test/eval_integrity.test.ts"],"cwd":"file:///home/mike/nexus-wt/eval-agent-toolchain-binds/cli","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"unknown","cmd":"TASK_HOME=$(mktemp -d /var/tmp/nexus-pr318-mask-home.XXXXXX); HOME=\"$TASK_HOME\" XDG_CONFIG_HOME=\"$TASK_HOME/.config\" node scripts/run_tests.mjs test/eval_integrity.test.ts"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","aggregated_output":"✔ the model proxy forwards requests and counts answers and upstream failures (173.104763ms)\n✔ the evaluation proxy authenticates the local run token and replaces it with the upstream credential (32.887075ms)\n✔ the evaluation proxy bounds request count and body size (21.341614ms)\n✔ the evaluation proxy bounds concurrent inference and cancels upstream work on client abort (50.159151ms)\n✔ the evaluation proxy enforces per-request and aggregate requested completion-token ceilings (35.035662ms)\n✔ the evaluation proxy never forwards the local token when the upstream is unauthenticated (14.221932ms)\n✔ infrastructure reruns use one rule for every agent: a crash after the model answered is scored (135.741712ms)\n✔ contaminated runs leave the pass rate, crashes are counted, and reruns are listed (77.458259ms)\n✔ T4 scoring requires all nine classes and five injected runs per class (651.830252ms)\n✔ task validation: pinned repos, one source, and black-box hidden oracle for qualification (34.66593ms)\n✔ T4 fixture evidence requires an exact CLI runner receipt and measured storage boundary (2.0622ms)\n✔ black-box oracle keeps canary expectations outside the candidate process and returns sanitized evidence (425.03098ms)\n✔ Python black-box oracle uses only pinned offline Go and Rust toolchains, or fails preflight (4398.852153ms)\n✔ a qualification run is refused without a model fingerprint (weights, server build, sampling) (1.227025ms)\n✔ qualification requires frozen request and aggregate output budgets (0.806657ms)\n✔ hidden tests must be unreadable to the agent's own user (2.062818ms)\n✔ candidate agents receive only the approved read-only Go and Rust toolchain mounts (0.95934ms)\n✔ qualification runtime mounts cannot overlap the task tree, held-out store, or private validator paths (133.481656ms)\n✔ qualification remains fail-closed without enforced aggregate resource controls (6.614251ms)\n✔ resource contract: candidate memory, processes, storage and CPU are kernel-bounded and every process is reaped (21335.535665ms)\n✔ resource supervisor preserves SIGTERM grace for descendants after the main payload exits (2615.290538ms)\n✔ candidate sandbox and resource supervisor compose around a staged repository (3455.552064ms)\n✔ repository workspaces carry no history beyond the pinned baseline commit (2829.685509ms)\n✔ task paths reject traversal, symlink escapes, and unstable task trees (9.187991ms)\n✔ task-tree digests frame paths, entry types, executable mode, and content lengths (23.116466ms)\n✔ task setup and validators run with cleared env, no network, confined filesystem, bounded output and timeout (4523.84071ms)\n✔ candidate namespace cannot read host files or bypass pinned compilers with absolute paths (698.203827ms)\n✔ qualification corpus binding rejects missing, mismatched, and post-seal task content (7.657941ms)\n✔ run.mjs refuses to start on an invalid task (220.866437ms)\n✔ the model proxy injects each scheduled fault into the chat request it names, and records it (52.78446ms)\n✔ executable probes refuse bind sources that overlap protected corpus material (