n 8 × 5 workload with no false absence or false presence (534.83593ms)\n✔ a steer counts as violable only if its constraint could fail: path present, or command failing at baseline (2.292815ms)\n✔ a command baseline that does not exit cleanly is a harness error, never a granted precondition (1.362357ms)\nℹ tests 13\nℹ suites 0\nℹ pass 13\nℹ fail 0\nℹ cancelled 0\nℹ skipped 0\nℹ todo 0\nℹ duration_ms 32901.063511\n","exit_code":0,"duration":{"secs":34,"nanos":141259348}},"started_at_ms":1793275475054,"completed_at_ms":1793275509196}}
