{"timestamp":"2026-10-29T12:06:38.181Z","ordinal":499889,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"agent_message","id":"amsg_01a1878e-1565-7211-91c9-2992259ae7fa","author":"/root/review_pr302","recipient":"/root","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Message Type: FINAL_ANSWER\nTask name: /root\nSender: /root/review_pr302\nPayload:\n**CHANGES_REQUIRED** — PR #318 candidate at HEAD `493bffde3c961c36631d644f0e25dca834702712`, base `df288ef010a93c418e4972d3d40dc293ec9c0081`. Working-tree diff SHA-256: `20e34b5a411b52f1474f6aac5f21f3288d920bffbea6b1f38ade942fa7961602`.\n\nThe masking order is sound for detected paths: system roots are mounted first, then compiler paths are overlaid with `/dev/null` in both candidate and oracle sandboxes ([isolate.mjs](/home/mike/nexus-wt/eval-agent-toolchain-binds/eval/isolate.mjs:534), [isolate.mjs](/home/mike/nexus-wt/eval-agent-toolchain-binds/eval/isolate.mjs:597)). Directory symlinks are skipped, but each actual mount root is scanned independently; ordinary compiler file symlinks are resolved and checked. Scan failures other than missing paths fail closed.\n\n- **P2 — Executable compiler candidates without ELF or shebang signatures escape masking.** [isolate.mjs](/home/mike/nexus-wt/eval-agent-toolchain-binds/eval/isolate.mjs:165) skips executable files whose first bytes are neither ELF nor `#!`. A compiler-named no-shebang script can still be run through an interpreter, for example `sh /usr/bin/rustc`; Linux `binfmt_misc` can also execute other formats. Since the path is not masked, absolute-path execution can bypass the pinned tools. Consider rejecting/masking compiler-named executable candidates except known non-executable compiler-like data such as terminfo, and add a no-shebang script fixture.\n\nI ran no tests or edits."}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a18771-cd08-7c60-9b2e-7bad123756d6","create_time":1793275598.181598,"content_item_metadata":[{"provenance":{"type":"tool","namespace":"collaboration"}}]}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"user_input_order":23340}}
