gets (0.914145ms)\\n✔ hidden tests must be unreadable to the agent's own user (2.424611ms)\\n✔ candidate agents receive only the approved read-only Go and Rust toolchain mounts (1.159326ms)\\n✔ qualification runtime mounts cannot overlap the task tree, held-out store, or private validator paths (132.320327ms)\\n✔ qualification remains fail-closed without enforced aggregate resource controls (9.385284ms)\\n✔ resource contract: candidate memory, processes, storage and CPU are kernel-bounded and every process is reaped (21805.66972ms)\\n✔ resource supervisor preserves SIGTERM grace for descendants after the main payload exits (2729.36671ms)\\n\"}"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a18771-cd08-7c60-9b2e-7bad123756d6","create_time":1793275812.269774}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
