{"timestamp":"2026-10-29T12:10:48.783Z","ordinal":500080,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a181ab-bb8d-7471-bcfe-7451f754e731","turn_id":"01a18771-cd08-7c60-9b2e-7bad123756d6","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-0933a0a2-c67c-4ed8-92c6-dfed394d76bf","process_id":"82151","command":["/usr/bin/zsh","-lc","isolated_test_home=$(mktemp -d); env HOME=\"$isolated_test_home\" XDG_CONFIG_HOME=\"$isolated_test_home/.config\" node scripts/run_tests.mjs test/eval_integrity.test.ts test/eval_t3.test.ts"],"cwd":"file:///home/mike/nexus-wt/eval-agent-toolchain-binds/cli","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"unknown","cmd":"isolated_test_home=$(mktemp -d); env HOME=\"$isolated_test_home\" XDG_CONFIG_HOME=\"$isolated_test_home/.config\" node scripts/run_tests.mjs test/eval_integrity.test.ts test/eval_t3.test.ts"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","aggregated_output":"✔ the model proxy forwards requests and counts answers and upstream failures (196.068219ms)\n✔ the evaluation proxy authenticates the local run token and replaces it with the upstream credential (50.68485ms)\n✔ the evaluation proxy bounds request count and body size (35.283485ms)\n✔ the evaluation proxy bounds concurrent inference and cancels upstream work on client abort (77.380247ms)\n✔ the evaluation proxy enforces per-request and aggregate requested completion-token ceilings (57.341597ms)\n✔ the evaluation proxy never forwards the local token when the upstream is unauthenticated (12.67931ms)\n✔ infrastructure reruns use one rule for every agent: a crash after the model answered is scored (138.423285ms)\n✔ contaminated runs leave the pass rate, crashes are counted, and reruns are listed (78.274389ms)\n✔ T4 scoring requires all nine classes and five injected runs per class (719.720393ms)\n✔ task validation: pinned repos, one source, and black-box hidden oracle for qualification (34.619503ms)\n✔ T4 fixture evidence requires an exact CLI runner receipt and measured storage boundary (2.289002ms)\n✔ black-box oracle keeps canary expectations outside the candidate process and returns sanitized evidence (414.303308ms)\n✔ Python black-box oracle uses only pinned offline Go and Rust toolchains, or fails preflight (3551.324088ms)\n✔ a qualification run is refused without a model fingerprint (weights, server build, sampling) (1.299591ms)\n✔ qualification requires frozen request and aggregate output budgets (0.914145ms)\n✔ hidden tests must be unreadable to the agent's own user (2.424611ms)\n✔ candidate agents receive only the approved read-only Go and Rust toolchain mounts (1.159326ms)\n✔ qualification runtime mounts cannot overlap the task tree, held-out store, or private validator paths (132.320327ms)\n✔ qualification remains fail-closed without enforced aggregate resource controls (9.385284ms)\n✔ resource contract: candidate memory, processes, storage and CPU are kernel-bounded and every process is reaped (21805.66972ms)\n✔ resource supervisor preserves SIGTERM grace for descendants after the main payload exits (2729.36671ms)\n✔ candidate sandbox and resource supervisor compose around a staged repository (3473.576441ms)\n✔ repository workspaces carry no history beyond the pinned baseline commit (1436.858073ms)\n✔ task paths reject traversal, symlink escapes, and unstable task trees (6.837168ms)\n✔ task-tree digests frame paths, entry types, executable mode, and content lengths (22.771542ms)\n✔ task setup and validators run with cleared env, no network, confined filesystem, bounded output and timeout (4498.35508ms)\n✔ candidate namespace cannot read host files or bypass pinned compilers with absolute paths (391.285101ms)\n✔ qualification corpus binding rejects missing, mismatched, and post-seal task content (10.03993ms)\n✔ run.mjs refuses to start on an invalid task (221.428698ms)\n✔ the model proxy injects each scheduled fault into the chat request it names, and records it (57.3574ms)\n✔ executable probes refuse bind sources that overlap protected corpus material (6.548589ms)\n✔ T3 task schema requires steering with checkable constraints, a fact sheet, a long budget and Nexus only (18.73022ms)\n✔ the T3 driver submits the objective, steers after the scripted tool calls, snapshots, probes, then shuts down (3405.421239ms)\n✔ the noninteractive T3 driver cancels a checkpoint choice request and does not hang (1.592684ms)\n✔ the probe answer is the last balanced JSON object (0.886868ms)\n✔ compactions count only ids a session or task record commits that have originals in its own archive (5.777215ms)\n✔ T3 evaluator rejects candidate symlinks in workspace facts and steering snapshots (6.302858ms)\n✔ T3 compaction counting rejects symlinks in HOME, .nexus categories, records and archives (10.420003ms)\n✔ T3 scoring judges the snapshot: steering honoured only when applied, violable and kept; false absence counted (2.566362ms)\n✔ a T3 run drives the real sidecar through the sandbox: steering applied, probe answered and scored (12400.140623ms)\n✔ the real T3 runner fails closed when a candidate-created fact path symlinks to an external canary (10062.189143ms)\n✔ the T3 gate passes only a full, clean 8 × 5 workload with no false absence or false presence (544.121604ms)\n✔ a steer counts as violable only if its constraint could fail: path present, or command failing at baseline (3.053557ms)\n✔ a command baseline that does not exit cleanly is a harness error, never a granted precondition (1.822024ms)\nℹ tests 44\nℹ suites 0\nℹ pass 44\nℹ fail 0\nℹ cancelled 0\nℹ skipped 0\nℹ todo 0\nℹ duration_ms 67676.680252\n","exit_code":0,"duration":{"secs":68,"nanos":831759418}},"started_at_ms":1793275779949,"completed_at_ms":1793275848781}}
