{"timestamp":"2026-10-29T12:11:10.198Z","ordinal":500102,"type":"token_usage_record","payload":{"thread_id":"01a181ab-bb8d-7471-bcfe-7451f754e731","turn_id":"01a18771-cd08-7c60-9b2e-7bad123756d6","session_id":"01a181ab-bb8d-7471-bcfe-7451f754e731","root_turn_id":"01a18771-cd08-7c60-9b2e-7bad123756d6","response_id":"resp_0db389702a7164cc016ae337d9a788819fb22dfbe8c36c199f","usage":{"input_tokens":89749,"cached_input_tokens":85376,"cache_write_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":396,"reasoning_output_tokens":379,"total_tokens":90145},"turn_token_usage":{"input_tokens":30135605,"cached_input_tokens":29620096,"cache_write_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":70262,"reasoning_output_tokens":38826,"total_tokens":30205867},"thread_token_usage":{"input_tokens":9354253405,"cached_input_tokens":9254317824,"cache_write_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":27102568,"reasoning_output_tokens":15902039,"total_tokens":9381355973}}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-29T12:11:10.240Z","ordinal":500103,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"function_call_output","id":"fco_01a18792-3c20-70b3-b20e-27afd5d204a2","call_id":"call_9e14f8f733eb40a098dc365152b2f012","output":"{\"agents\":[{\"agent_name\":\"/root\",\"agent_status\":\"running\"},{\"agent_name\":\"/root/pr311_draft_review\",\"agent_status\":{\"completed\":\"**ACCEPT** — exact four-file diff SHA-256: `56ab8a3ecef2ada575aacd09e3e5148948fb6b013640c92b071d11598a629184`.\\n\\nPinned toolchain roots and their contents are checked for root ownership, canonical paths, and write/symlink safety before use. Candidate and Python oracle mounts are read-only; oracle launches clear the environment, use offline Go/Rust settings and temporary caches, and refuse protected-corpus overlap. The fixtures cover unsafe roots, production launch paths, and Go/Rust execution.\\n\\n**Independence note:** I previously reviewed related evaluator-toolchain and provisioning changes, so this is a fresh review of the exact candidate, but should not be represented as fully independent of those earlier reviews. No tests run.\"}},{\"agent_name\":\"/root/review_pr300_readiness\",\"agent_status\":{\"completed\":\"**CHANGES_REQUIRED** for PR #323. Its exact head is `ea7b728c70ba05d7ff106c14c0adffd99e6012a5`; the diff SHA-256 is `535d7f5244de1708f2e90931bcf730002d341ea15fb241ae2d196805e734c872`.\\n\\nThe six changed files are synchronized RC11 version metadata and the new release notes. The notes accurately preserve the outstanding qualification gates and DEC-18/DEC-19 terminal requirements.\\n\\nThe toolchain statement in `docs/releases/v1.0.0-rc.11.md:29` overstates what this candidate enforces. CI provisions toolchain directories, but the current evaluator source still dynamically selects Go and Rust toolchains; PR #318, which adds fail-closed pinned-toolchain enforcement, remains open.\\n\\nNode 22/24, JS/TS, and CodeQL checks pass. Linux and Entire Gates are still running. After correcting the statement, the PR may be considered for merge once all required exact-head checks and independent review pass.\"}},{\"agent_name\":\"/root/review_pr302\",\"agent_status\":{\"completed\":\"**ACCEPT** — HEAD `493bffde3c961c36631d644f0e25dca834702712`, base `df288ef010a93c418e4972d3d40dc293ec9c0081`. Current working-tree diff SHA-256: `4149506160ba8cd8ee895945720b59455648d7a149eb991b23f26cfb9d4ed588`.\\n\\nThe no-shebang gap is fixed: executable compiler-named candidates are masked regardless of ELF or shebang signature. The terminfo exception is limited to known magic bytes under a `terminfo` path, and fixtures cover both cases ([isolate.mjs](/home/mike/nexus-wt/eval-agent-toolchain-binds/eval/isolate.mjs:165), [eval_integrity.test.ts](/home/mike/nexus-wt/eval-agent-toolchain-binds/cli/test/eval_integrity.test.ts:516)). System roots and alternatives are mounted before `/dev/null` overlays are added, so absolute paths are masked in both sandbox types.\\n\\nRead-only source review; no tests run.\"}}]}","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a18771-cd08-7c60-9b2e-7bad123756d6","create_time":1793275870.2405577}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
