{"timestamp":"2026-10-29T12:13:06.548Z","ordinal":500182,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a181ab-bb8d-7471-bcfe-7451f754e731","turn_id":"01a18771-cd08-7c60-9b2e-7bad123756d6","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-a9785fb6-9429-4329-98cf-1af903f18155","process_id":"13592","command":["/usr/bin/zsh","-lc","isolated_test_home=$(mktemp -d); env HOME=\"$isolated_test_home\" XDG_CONFIG_HOME=\"$isolated_test_home/.config\" node scripts/run_tests.mjs test/eval_integrity.test.ts test/eval_t3.test.ts"],"cwd":"file:///home/mike/nexus-wt/eval-agent-toolchain-binds/cli","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"unknown","cmd":"isolated_test_home=$(mktemp -d); env HOME=\"$isolated_test_home\" XDG_CONFIG_HOME=\"$isolated_test_home/.config\" node scripts/run_tests.mjs test/eval_integrity.test.ts test/eval_t3.test.ts"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","aggregated_output":"✔ the model proxy forwards requests and counts answers and upstream failures (204.569851ms)\n✔ the evaluation proxy authenticates the local run token and replaces it with the upstream credential (38.374927ms)\n✔ the evaluation proxy bounds request count and body size (16.322067ms)\n✔ the evaluation proxy bounds concurrent inference and cancels upstream work on client abort (55.134551ms)\n✔ the evaluation proxy enforces per-request and aggregate requested completion-token ceilings (33.71074ms)\n✔ the evaluation proxy never forwards the local token when the upstream is unauthenticated (11.920527ms)\n✔ infrastructure reruns use one rule for every agent: a crash after the model answered is scored (158.945565ms)\n✔ contaminated runs leave the pass rate, crashes are counted, and reruns are listed (90.087563ms)\n✔ T4 scoring requires all nine classes and five injected runs per class (671.029516ms)\n✔ task validation: pinned repos, one source, and black-box hidden oracle for qualification (33.15311ms)\n✔ T4 fixture evidence requires an exact CLI runner receipt and measured storage boundary (2.090212ms)\n✔ black-box oracle keeps canary expectations outside the candidate process and returns sanitized evidence (401.280661ms)\n✔ Python black-box oracle uses only pinned offline Go and Rust toolchains, or fails preflight (4027.336356ms)\n✔ a qualification run is refused without a model fingerprint (weights, server build, sampling) (1.471353ms)\n✔ qualification requires frozen request and aggregate output budgets (1.023162ms)\n✔ hidden tests must be unreadable to the agent's own user (2.217427ms)\n✔ candidate agents receive only the approved read-only Go and Rust toolchain mounts (1.267566ms)\n✔ qualification runtime mounts cannot overlap the task tree, held-out store, or private validator paths (129.813393ms)\n✔ qualification remains fail-closed without enforced aggregate resource controls (7.682244ms)\n✔ resource contract: candidate memory, processes, storage and CPU are kernel-bounded and every process is reaped (20604.434794ms)\n✔ resource supervisor preserves SIGTERM grace for descendants after the main payload exits (2553.821534ms)\n✔ candidate sandbox and resource supervisor compose around a staged repository (3456.483098ms)\n✔ repository workspaces carry no history beyond the pinned baseline commit (1350.900286ms)\n✔ task paths reject traversal, symlink escapes, and unstable task trees (5.324275ms)\n✔ task-tree digests frame paths, entry types, executable mode, and content lengths (21.165916ms)\n✔ task setup and validators run with cleared env, no network, confined filesystem, bounded output and timeout (4515.70066ms)\n✔ candidate namespace cannot read host files or bypass pinned compilers with absolute paths (432.608244ms)\n✔ qualification corpus binding rejects missing, mismatched, and post-seal task content (8.02545ms)\n✔ run.mjs refuses to start on an invalid task (218.472833ms)\n✔ the model proxy injects each scheduled fault into the chat request it names, and records it (87.470668ms)\n✔ executable probes refuse bind sources that overlap protected corpus material (6.586534ms)\n✔ T3 task schema requires steering with checkable constraints, a fact sheet, a long budget and Nexus only (22.189375ms)\n✔ the T3 driver submits the objective, steers after the scripted tool calls, snapshots, probes, then shuts down (3406.849933ms)\n✔ the noninteractive T3 driver cancels a checkpoint choice request and does not hang (2.350454ms)\n✔ the probe answer is the last balanced JSON object (1.382437ms)\n✔ compactions count only ids a session or task record commits that have originals in its own archive (9.850873ms)\n✔ T3 evaluator rejects candidate symlinks in workspace facts and steering snapshots (9.695108ms)\n✔ T3 compaction counting rejects symlinks in HOME, .nexus categories, records and archives (13.943005ms)\n✔ T3 scoring judges the snapshot: steering honoured only when applied, violable and kept; false absence counted (4.207918ms)\n✔ a T3 run drives the real sidecar through the sandbox: steering applied, probe answered and scored (12894.401849ms)\n✔ the real T3 runner fails closed when a candidate-created fact path symlinks to an external canary (9313.284705ms)\n✔ the T3 gate passes only a full, clean 8 × 5 workload with no false absence or false presence (523.43251ms)\n✔ a steer counts as violable only if its constraint could fail: path present, or command failing at baseline (3.206837ms)\n✔ a command baseline that does not exit cleanly is a harness error, never a granted precondition (2.158389ms)\nℹ tests 44\nℹ suites 0\nℹ pass 44\nℹ fail 0\nℹ cancelled 0\nℹ skipped 0\nℹ todo 0\nℹ duration_ms 66095.771005\n","exit_code":0,"duration":{"secs":67,"nanos":251651375}},"started_at_ms":1793275919294,"completed_at_ms":1793275986546}}
