ocument using the System Design template and its retained reference file. Use when the user selects or names System Design. Document system architecture, requirements, components, data flows, APIs, tradeoffs, and operational considerations.\\\",\\\"mimeType\\\":\\\"mcp/skill\\\",\\\"_meta\\\":{\\\"plugin_id\\\":\\\"plugin_connector_1p_2330815c823c8191941e5dc465bb899f\\\",\\\"plugin_name\\\":\\\"openai-templates\\\",\\\"plugin_release_id\\\":\\\"pluginrel_6a6ced4ebc8c8191bf7c17972c03db1c\\\",\\\"plugin_release_skill_id\\\":\\\"pluginrsk_6a6ced4fdc2481918c654b7fa5b8a772\\\",\\\"skill_name\\\":\\\"artifact-template-system-design\\\",\\\"contents\\\":[\\\"assets\\\"],\\\"allow_implicit_invocation\\\":false}},{\\\"server\\\":\\\"codex_apps\\\",\\\"uri\\\":\\\"skill://plugin_connector_1p_2330815c823c8191941e5dc465bb899f/artifact-template-team-alignment\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"plugin_connector_1p_2330815c823c8191941e5dc465bb899f/artifact-template-team-alignment\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Team Alignment\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Create a presentation using the Team Alignment template and its retained reference file. Use when the user selects or names Team Alignment. Facilitate team offsites and planning with context, goals, priorities, decisions, and action items.\\\",\\\"mimeType\\\":\\\"mcp/skill\\\",\\\"_meta\\\":{\\\"plugin_id\\\":\\\"plugin_connector_1p_2330815c823c8191941e5dc465bb899f\\\",\\\"plugin_name\\\":\\\"openai-templates\\\",\\\"plugin_release_id\\\":\\\"pluginrel_6a6ced4ebc8c8191bf7c17972c03db1c\\\",\\\"plugin_release_skill_id\\\":\\\"pluginrsk_6a6ced4fdc288191a9c1edc952010f81\\\",\\\"skill_name\\\":\\\"artifact-template-team-alignment\\\",\\\"contents\\\":[\\\"assets\\\"],\\\"allow_implicit_invocation\\\":false}},{\\\"server\\\":\\\"codex_apps\\\",\\\"uri\\\":\\\"skill://plugin_connector_1p_2330815c823c8191941e5dc465bb899f/artifact-template-three-statement-forecast\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"plugin_connector_1p_2330815c823c8191941e5dc465bb899f/artifact-template-three-st