ewer confirmed no Entire approval integration or distinct identity is available in their session, so the required trail approval remains outstanding. PR [#292](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/292) remains on base `8b24d8e1`, is reported conflicting against current main, and its Entire Gates check failed for missing reviewer approval and staleness. Its remote checks do not establish current-base readiness. No merge is inferred from stale checks.\n","exit_code":0,"duration":{"secs":0,"nanos":752808023}},"started_at_ms":1793276469144,"completed_at_ms":1793276469897}}
