✖ Python black-box oracle uses only pinned offline Go and Rust toolchains, or fails preflight (15.63639ms)\n✔ a qualification run is refused without a model fingerprint (weights, server build, sampling) (1.107592ms)\n✔ qualification requires frozen request and aggregate output budgets (0.867449ms)\n✔ hidden tests must be unreadable to the agent's own user (2.145647ms)\n✔ candidate agents receive only the approved read-only Go and Rust toolchain mounts (0.960502ms)\n✔ qualification runtime mounts cannot overlap the task tree, held-out store, or private validator paths (448.318883ms)\n✔ qualification remains fail-closed without enforced aggregate resource controls (6.775614ms)\n✔ resource contract: candidate memory, processes, storage and CPU are kernel-bounded and every process is reaped (24577.270164ms)\n✔ resource supervisor preserves SIGTERM grace for descendants after the main payload exits (2597.726537ms)\n✔ candidate sandbox and resource supervisor compose around a staged repository (3451.714444ms)\n✔ repository workspaces carry no history beyond the pinned baseline commit (1483.1326ms)\n✔ task paths reject traversal, symlink escapes, and unstable task trees (6.555774ms)\n✔ task-tree digests frame paths, entry types, executable mode, and content lengths (24.815899ms)\n✔ task setup and validators run with cleared env, no network, confined filesystem, bounded output and timeout (4530.043614ms)\n✔ candidate namespace cannot read host files or bypass pinned compilers with absolute paths (395.95835ms)\n✔ qualification corpus binding rejects missing, mismatched, and post-seal task content (7.733047ms)\n✔ run.mjs refuses to start on an invalid task (204.67135ms)\n✔ the model proxy injects each scheduled fault into the chat request it names, and records it (59.960112ms)\n✔ executable probes refuse bind sources that overlap protected corpus material (7.469428ms)\n✔ T3 task schema requires steering with checkable constraints, a fact sheet, a long budget and Nexus only (19.283481ms)\n✔ the T3 driver submits the objective, steers after the scripted tool calls, snapshots, probes, then shuts down (3405.304086ms)\n✔ the noninteractive T3 driver cancels a checkpoint choice request and does not hang (1.699667ms)\n✔ the probe answer is the last balanced JSON object (0.803591ms)\n✔ compactions count only ids a session or task record commits that have originals in its own archive (6.215796ms)\n✔ T3 evaluator rejects candidate symlinks in workspace facts and steering snapshots (5.850838ms)\n✔ T3 compaction counting rejects symlinks in HOME, .nexus categories, records and archives (5.238309ms)\n✔ T3 scoring judges the snapshot: steering honoured only when applied, violable and kept; false absence counted (2.259404ms)\n✔ a T3 run drives the real sidecar through the sandbox: steering applied, probe answered and scored (11740.233787ms)\n✔ the real T3 runner fails closed when a candidate-created fact path symlinks to an external canary (9647.905444ms)\n✔ the T3 gate passes only a full, clean 8 × 5 workload with no false absence or false presence (512.970032ms)\n✔ a steer counts as violable only if its constraint could fail: path present, or command failing at baseline (2.582329ms)\n✔ a command baseline that does not exit cleanly is a harness error, never a granted precondition (1.595949ms)\nℹ tests 44\nℹ suites 0\nℹ pass 43\nℹ fail 1\nℹ cancelled 0\nℹ skipped 0\nℹ todo 0\nℹ duration_ms 65772.793524\n\n✖ failing tests:\n\ntest at test/eval_integrity.test.ts:479:1\n✖ Python black-box oracle uses only pinned offline Go and Rust toolchains, or fails preflight (15.63639ms)\n  AssertionError [ERR_ASSERTION]: The input did not match the regular expression /rustc-alias/. Input:\n  \n  'unapproved Go/Rust compiler executable is exposed through oracle system mounts: /tmp/eval-oracle-unpinned-compiler-system-Qn5zmj/bin/cargo-1.94.0, /tmp/eval-oracle-unpinned-compiler-system-Qn5zmj/bin/rustc-1.94.0, /tmp/eval-oracle-unpinned-compiler-system-Qn5zmj/lib/go-1.22