{"timestamp":"2026-10-29T12:41:53.720Z","ordinal":501296,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a181ab-bb8d-7471-bcfe-7451f754e731","turn_id":"01a18771-cd08-7c60-9b2e-7bad123756d6","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-52cc3460-007e-44c7-ad37-a94633c35d30","process_id":"65439","command":["/usr/bin/zsh","-lc","node scripts/run_tests.mjs test/eval_integrity.test.ts test/eval_t3.test.ts"],"cwd":"file:///home/mike/nexus-wt/eval-agent-toolchain-binds/cli","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"unknown","cmd":"node scripts/run_tests.mjs test/eval_integrity.test.ts test/eval_t3.test.ts"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","aggregated_output":"✔ the model proxy forwards requests and counts answers and upstream failures (183.861952ms)\n✔ the evaluation proxy authenticates the local run token and replaces it with the upstream credential (41.428005ms)\n✔ the evaluation proxy bounds request count and body size (19.948659ms)\n✔ the evaluation proxy bounds concurrent inference and cancels upstream work on client abort (42.163694ms)\n✔ the evaluation proxy enforces per-request and aggregate requested completion-token ceilings (51.553261ms)\n✔ the evaluation proxy never forwards the local token when the upstream is unauthenticated (12.261316ms)\n✔ infrastructure reruns use one rule for every agent: a crash after the model answered is scored (132.953685ms)\n✔ contaminated runs leave the pass rate, crashes are counted, and reruns are listed (77.153539ms)\n✔ T4 scoring requires all nine classes and five injected runs per class (632.466883ms)\n✔ task validation: pinned repos, one source, and black-box hidden oracle for qualification (31.159874ms)\n✔ T4 fixture evidence requires an exact CLI runner receipt and measured storage boundary (1.927991ms)\n✔ black-box oracle keeps canary expectations outside the candidate process and returns sanitized evidence (384.736002ms)\n✔ Python black-box oracle uses only pinned offline Go and Rust toolchains, or fails preflight (3527.558119ms)\n✔ a qualification run is refused without a model fingerprint (weights, server build, sampling) (1.177979ms)\n✔ qualification requires frozen request and aggregate output budgets (0.840205ms)\n✔ hidden tests must be unreadable to the agent's own user (2.216675ms)\n✔ candidate agents receive only the approved read-only Go and Rust toolchain mounts (0.910945ms)\n✔ qualification runtime mounts cannot overlap the task tree, held-out store, or private validator paths (170.237405ms)\n✔ qualification remains fail-closed without enforced aggregate resource controls (7.259107ms)\n✔ resource contract: candidate memory, processes, storage and CPU are kernel-bounded and every process is reaped (20950.041519ms)\n✔ resource supervisor preserves SIGTERM grace for descendants after the main payload exits (2571.068785ms)\n✔ candidate sandbox and resource supervisor compose around a staged repository (3400.725923ms)\n✔ repository workspaces carry no history beyond the pinned baseline commit (1567.833413ms)\n✔ task paths reject traversal, symlink escapes, and unstable task trees (6.560571ms)\n✔ task-tree digests frame paths, entry types, executable mode, and content lengths (24.518221ms)\n✔ task setup and validators run with cleared env, no network, confined filesystem, bounded output and timeout (4522.203718ms)\n✔ candidate namespace cannot read host files or bypass pinned compilers with absolute paths (368.866634ms)\n✔ qualification corpus binding rejects missing, mismatched, and post-seal task content (6.35194ms)\n✔ run.mjs refuses to start on an invalid task (221.429369ms)\n✔ the model proxy injects each scheduled fault into the chat request it names, and records it (52.281646ms)\n✔ executable probes refuse bind sources that overlap protected corpus material (6.420062ms)\n✔ T3 task schema requires steering with checkable constraints, a fact sheet, a long budget and Nexus only (19.71228ms)\n✔ the T3 driver submits the objective, steers after the scripted tool calls, snapshots, probes, then shuts down (3409.719313ms)\n✔ the noninteractive T3 driver cancels a checkpoint choice request and does not hang (2.212637ms)\n✔ the probe answer is the last balanced JSON object (1.057704ms)\n✔ compactions count only ids a session or task record commits that have originals in its own archive (6.935574ms)\n✔ T3 evaluator rejects candidate symlinks in workspace facts and steering snapshots (6.932223ms)\n✔ T3 compaction counting rejects symlinks in HOME, .nexus categories, records and archives (5.917961ms)\n✔ T3 scoring judges the snapshot: steering honoured only when applied, violable and kept; false absence counted (2.658202ms)\n✔ a T3 run drives the real sidecar through the sandbox: steering applied, probe answered and scored (12707.843823ms)\n✔ the real T3 runner fails closed when a candidate-created fact path symlinks to an external canary (9800.412708ms)\n✔ the T3 gate passes only a full, clean 8 × 5 workload with no false absence or false presence (511.845398ms)\n✔ a steer counts as violable only if its constraint could fail: path present, or command failing at baseline (2.234925ms)\n✔ a command baseline that does not exit cleanly is a harness error, never a granted precondition (1.412431ms)\nℹ tests 44\nℹ suites 0\nℹ pass 44\nℹ fail 0\nℹ cancelled 0\nℹ skipped 0\nℹ todo 0\nℹ duration_ms 66483.78662\n","exit_code":0,"duration":{"secs":67,"nanos":606077366}},"started_at_ms":1793277646111,"completed_at_ms":1793277713718}}
