{"timestamp":"2026-10-29T12:49:08.944Z","ordinal":501717,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a181ab-bb8d-7471-bcfe-7451f754e731","turn_id":"01a18771-cd08-7c60-9b2e-7bad123756d6","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-82721d3c-92fa-45fd-ba57-f240744c381e","process_id":"91937","command":["/usr/bin/zsh","-lc","node scripts/run_tests.mjs test/eval_integrity.test.ts test/eval_t3.test.ts"],"cwd":"file:///home/mike/nexus-wt/eval-agent-toolchain-binds/cli","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"unknown","cmd":"node scripts/run_tests.mjs test/eval_integrity.test.ts test/eval_t3.test.ts"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","aggregated_output":"✔ the model proxy forwards requests and counts answers and upstream failures (178.636966ms)\n✔ the evaluation proxy authenticates the local run token and replaces it with the upstream credential (26.539767ms)\n✔ the evaluation proxy bounds request count and body size (18.172332ms)\n✔ the evaluation proxy bounds concurrent inference and cancels upstream work on client abort (53.526882ms)\n✔ the evaluation proxy enforces per-request and aggregate requested completion-token ceilings (29.199487ms)\n✔ the evaluation proxy never forwards the local token when the upstream is unauthenticated (9.470881ms)\n✔ infrastructure reruns use one rule for every agent: a crash after the model answered is scored (135.846245ms)\n✔ contaminated runs leave the pass rate, crashes are counted, and reruns are listed (76.375086ms)\n✔ T4 scoring requires all nine classes and five injected runs per class (630.288491ms)\n✔ task validation: pinned repos, one source, and black-box hidden oracle for qualification (34.00879ms)\n✔ T4 fixture evidence requires an exact CLI runner receipt and measured storage boundary (2.016276ms)\n✔ black-box oracle keeps canary expectations outside the candidate process and returns sanitized evidence (402.892262ms)\n✔ Python black-box oracle uses only pinned offline Go and Rust toolchains, or fails preflight (4212.973936ms)\n✔ a qualification run is refused without a model fingerprint (weights, server build, sampling) (1.153527ms)\n✔ qualification requires frozen request and aggregate output budgets (0.746287ms)\n✔ hidden tests must be unreadable to the agent's own user (2.140362ms)\n✔ candidate agents receive only the approved read-only Go and Rust toolchain mounts (0.848279ms)\n✔ qualification runtime mounts cannot overlap the task tree, held-out store, or private validator paths (110.841846ms)\n✔ qualification remains fail-closed without enforced aggregate resource controls (6.216189ms)\n✔ resource contract: candidate memory, processes, storage and CPU are kernel-bounded and every process is reaped (21486.779488ms)\n✔ resource supervisor preserves SIGTERM grace for descendants after the main payload exits (2578.817722ms)\n✔ candidate sandbox and resource supervisor compose around a staged repository (8109.184226ms)\n✔ repository workspaces carry no history beyond the pinned baseline commit (1528.491854ms)\n✔ task paths reject traversal, symlink escapes, and unstable task trees (5.70807ms)\n✔ task-tree digests frame paths, entry types, executable mode, and content lengths (24.270775ms)\n✔ task setup and validators run with cleared env, no network, confined filesystem, bounded output and timeout (4578.901957ms)\n✔ candidate namespace cannot read host files or bypass pinned compilers with absolute paths (380.252978ms)\n✔ qualification corpus binding rejects missing, mismatched, and post-seal task content (6.806796ms)\n✔ run.mjs refuses to start on an invalid task (200.587507ms)\n✔ the model proxy injects each scheduled fault into the chat request it names, and records it (63.923496ms)\n✔ executable probes refuse bind sources that overlap protected corpus material (4.79999ms)\n✔ T3 task schema requires steering with checkable constraints, a fact sheet, a long budget and Nexus only (21.720297ms)\n✔ the T3 driver submits the objective, steers after the scripted tool calls, snapshots, probes, then shuts down (3405.770177ms)\n✔ the noninteractive T3 driver cancels a checkpoint choice request and does not hang (4.107469ms)\n✔ the probe answer is the last balanced JSON object (1.212208ms)\n✔ compactions count only ids a session or task record commits that have originals in its own archive (7.519846ms)\n✔ T3 evaluator rejects candidate symlinks in workspace facts and steering snapshots (7.316598ms)\n✔ T3 compaction counting rejects symlinks in HOME, .nexus categories, records and archives (6.448898ms)\n✔ T3 scoring judges the snapshot: steering honoured only when applied, violable and kept; false absence counted (2.686804ms)\n✔ a T3 run drives the real sidecar through the sandbox: steering applied, probe answered and scored (18114.848385ms)\n✔ the real T3 runner fails closed when a candidate-created fact path symlinks to an external canary (14104.335984ms)\n✔ the T3 gate passes only a full, clean 8 × 5 workload with no false absence or false presence (569.969143ms)\n✔ a steer counts as violable only if its constraint could fail: path present, or command failing at baseline (2.213395ms)\n✔ a command baseline that does not exit cleanly is a harness error, never a granted precondition (1.542615ms)\nℹ tests 44\nℹ suites 0\nℹ pass 44\nℹ fail 0\nℹ cancelled 0\nℹ skipped 0\nℹ todo 0\nℹ duration_ms 81823.388344\n","exit_code":0,"duration":{"secs":83,"nanos":13029429}},"started_at_ms":1793278065931,"completed_at_ms":1793278148944}}
