{"timestamp":"2026-10-29T13:08:33.129Z","ordinal":502535,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"agent_message","id":"amsg_01a187c6-c4e9-7d42-bef9-61e21f33bd50","author":"/root/review_pr300_readiness","recipient":"/root","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Message Type: FINAL_ANSWER\nTask name: /root\nSender: /root/review_pr300_readiness\nPayload:\n**ACCEPT** for PR #318 at head `76c9bfe8e509b00e85611b684d53d135f4917366`.\n\n- Delta hash (`1eb9999..76c9bfe`): `f398ffcb83bf9eb14a1ffd4b6a32ec3a4db8480977eddc28c80a9e641fb6fc16`\n- Cumulative hash (base `078f12b11f32ebde7a28477cddba1b68e5206ca4`): `8f79addb516e72337f12ac3763089e18f5d04974aadd34530221b8c0ca1e1813`\n\nThe launch path performs one fresh compiler-exposure scan, then checks pinned toolchain roots and versions. The cache remains removed. The regression test scans a clean temporary root, adds an executable Go canary, and verifies both oracle and candidate checks detect it—covering the previous stale-cache failure.\n\nNo files were changed and no suites were run."}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a18771-cd08-7c60-9b2e-7bad123756d6","create_time":1793279313.1291971,"content_item_metadata":[{"provenance":{"type":"tool","namespace":"collaboration"}}]}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"user_input_order":23424}}
