ied_exec_startup","status":"completed","aggregated_output":"## v1/eval-agent-toolchain-binds...origin/v1/eval-agent-toolchain-binds\n76c9bfe8 (HEAD -> v1/eval-agent-toolchain-binds, origin/v1/eval-agent-toolchain-binds) perf(eval): reuse compiler scan within probe\n1eb99993 fix(eval): rescan compiler exposure before qualification\n2703a763 Merge remote-tracking branch 'origin/main' into v1/eval-agent-toolchain-binds\n76c9bfe8e509b00e85611b684d53d135f4917366\n078f12b11f32ebde7a28477cddba1b68e5206ca4\n{\"baseRefOid\":\"078f12b11f32ebde7a28477cddba1b68e5206ca4\",\"headRefOid\":\"76c9bfe8e509b00e85611b684d53d135f4917366\",\"mergeStateStatus\":\"BLOCKED\",\"reviewDecision\":\"\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-10-29T13:07:59Z\"}\n[{\"link\":\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40879084541/job/123465459308\",\"name\":\"test-matrix (22)\",\"state\":\"IN_PROGRESS\"},{\"link\":\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40879084550/job/123465458542\",\"name\":\"javascript-typescript\",\"state\":\"IN_PROGRESS\"},{\"link\":\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40879084541/job/123465459680\",\"name\":\"test-matrix (24)\",\"state\":\"IN_PROGRESS\"},{\"link\":\"https://entire.com/gh/mikeholownych/-/trails/33/changes/nexus-code/33\",\"name\":\"Entire Gates\",\"state\":\"IN_PROGRESS\"},{\"link\":\"\",\"name\":\"CodeRabbit\",\"state\":\"SUCCESS\"}]\n\nACTIVE SUITE DIRECTORIES\n\nENTIRE FILES\nls: cannot access '.entire': No such file or directory\n/home/mike/nexus-code/.entire:\ntotal 40\ndrwxr-x---  5 mike mike 4096 Oct 28 07:40 .\ndrwxrwxr-x 28 mike mike 4096 Oct 29 12:55 ..\n-rw-r--r--  1 mike mike   58 Oct 28 01:10 .gitignore\n-rw-r--r--  1 mike mike 5397 Oct 28 07:40 agent-guide.md\ndrwxr-x---  2 mike mike 4096 Oct 28 01:10 logs\ndrwxr-x---  8 mike mike 4096 Oct 28 15:18 metadata\n-rw-r--r--  1 mike mike  115 Oct 28 01:10 settings.json\n-rw-r--r--  1 mike mike   78 Oct 28 07:27 settings.local.json\ndrwxr-x---  2 mike mike 4096 Oct 