er custodian as the `opencode` primary session (integrator/custodian, not task author); they do not identify a human operator. The handoff log later names SageBridge, but the subsequent `coordination_only` status and current claim file leave the active custodian unclear.\\n\\nThe remaining custod\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-29T07:12:13Z\"},{\"author\":\"mikeholownych\",\"body\":\"Coordinator follow-up (metadata only; no held-out payloads accessed).\\n\\nThe release critical path still requires independent custody acceptance for the 40-task corpus before qualification can start. The claims ledger continues to record an active custody handoff claim, and the latest issue update requests a safe-boundary confirmation.\\n\\nPlease reply with status only:\\n\\n1. Who currently owns corpus au\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-29T12:59:35Z\"}],\"state\":\"OPEN\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-10-29T12:59:35Z\"}\n"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a18771-cd08-7c60-9b2e-7bad123756d6","create_time":1793279505.3377333}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
