{"timestamp":"2026-10-29T13:30:20.536Z","ordinal":503509,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"agent_message","id":"amsg_01a187da-b7f8-7421-873f-6b6d890e5241","author":"/root/review_pr302","recipient":"/root","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Message Type: FINAL_ANSWER\nTask name: /root\nSender: /root/review_pr302\nPayload:\n**CHANGES_REQUIRED** — reviewed HEAD `80c13e5b48285f763f054db18ad89d20f81a5dbe`; delta from `76c9bfe8e509b00e85611b684d53d135f4917366` SHA-256: `50eb41fbf4961608b3554630244aa71831843a719d7e6b5f7a7cea203eef82f9`. No tests run; no held-out content accessed.\n\nThe optional-root behavior and Rust fallback are sensible: `candidateToolchainRootSources` validates each source before selecting it ([eval/isolate.mjs:79](/home/mike/nexus-wt/eval-agent-toolchain-binds/eval/isolate.mjs:79)), and the fallback Rust source is mounted at the expected sandbox path. However, the compiler scanner exempts **all** declared root spellings, even when a root was rejected ([eval/isolate.mjs:140](/home/mike/nexus-wt/eval-agent-toolchain-binds/eval/isolate.mjs:140)). If an unsafe `/usr/local/nexus-qual/rust` is explicitly added to `sandboxRuntimePaths` with `/usr/local` allowed, the scanner skips its compiler. `agentSandboxArgv` then mounts selected toolchains first, mounts explicit runtime paths afterward, and applies masks last ([eval/isolate.mjs:555](/home/mike/nexus-wt/eval-agent-toolchain-binds/eval/isolate.mjs:555), [eval/isolate.mjs:570](/home/mike/nexus-wt/eval-agent-toolchain-binds/eval/isolate.mjs:570), [eval/isolate.mjs:576](/home/mike/nexus-wt/eval-agent-toolchain-binds/eval/isolate.mjs:576)). That explicit bind can replace the validated fallback with the rejected compiler.\n\nPass only the validated, selected toolchain roots to the scanner’s exemption logic; scan and mask any compiler under an inactive or rejected root. Add a regression where an invalid pinned-root spelling is explicitly mounted and its compiler remains masked. The new test only verifies that an unsafe root is omitted from toolchain selection ([eval_integrity.test.ts:580](/home/mike/nexus-wt/eval-agent-toolchain-binds/cli/test/eval_integrity.test.ts:580))."}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a18771-cd08-7c60-9b2e-7bad123756d6","create_time":1793280620.5362275,"content_item_metadata":[{"provenance":{"type":"tool","namespace":"collaboration"}}]}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"user_input_order":23449}}
