{"timestamp":"2026-10-29T13:33:39.409Z","ordinal":503708,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a181ab-bb8d-7471-bcfe-7451f754e731","turn_id":"01a18771-cd08-7c60-9b2e-7bad123756d6","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_0db389702a7164cc016ae34b329788819fb93b5a0bc8cb5647","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"The test failure was an outdated expectation that the Rust source directory must be `/usr/local/nexus-qual/rust`; this host correctly selects `/opt/nexus-qual/rust` and binds it at the canonical guest location. I’ve updated that expectation and added a production-argv regression proving an explicitly mounted inactive compiler is masked after its bind. I’m rerunning the two focused test files now."}],"phase":"commentary"},"started_at_ms":1793280818628,"completed_at_ms":1793280819409}}
