{"timestamp":"2026-10-29T13:39:37.452Z","ordinal":504018,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call_output","id":"ctco_01a187e3-376c-7583-b4b1-a44321366798","call_id":"call_bfb4f9d2f8b042aea924a9769d2a648f","output":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Script completed\nWall time 1.2 seconds\nOutput:\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"rg: .git/nexus-claims.log: Not a directory (os error 20)\ndocs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md:29:**Suite evidence:** `make test` completed on immutable snapshot `03bfaa394c906d900574f35104e521844049403c` with isolated HOME and the required evaluator workspace/runtime fixtures: 1,993 tests across 224 suites, 1,991 passed, 0 failed, 2 skipped, 0 cancelled; Rust tests and post-test security lifecycle gates passed. The full run took 3,167,118 ms. This snapshot is not exact current main, PR #311 candidate `fe28ec9`, or an RC, so the result does not qualify those revisions. The SUITE claim transferred to the OpenCode custodian at 04:18 UTC for the 20-task custody revalidation above.\ndocs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md:51:**Release PRs:** PR [#299](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/299) is merged at `004234de6d8599d71083b4f686c1bdbffe21dd2f`, included in current main. PR [#302](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/302) is based on `145d464` at exact head `49a2af0c1d556912d12b834aa7f2022ef63b528c`; its latest follow-up scopes checkout to the nested workspace and extends the regression to preserve both staged and unstaged sibling state. The prior nested-index delta at `662d084` was independently ACCEPTed (SHA-256 `61f4e40bc135152ffa003c82bdc31fc15703542b5bd9ba3b67f7b6b1edae1cb2`), and the checkout-scope delta was independently ACCEPTed by `review_pr302` (SHA-256 `26ce020bdc1f6865e194f02e45c6889eaa32415cc786a457fbcfae1ddaa78605`, tests not run). PR #302 CodeQL and JS/TS checks pass; Node 22/24 CI and Entire are running. TypeScript `--noEmit` and `git diff --check` passed on the prior delta; no local suite was run under the active SUITE claim.\n"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a18771-cd08-7c60-9b2e-7bad123756d6","create_time":1793281177.4527984}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
