E\"\nmkdir \"$suite_claim\"\nsuite_pid=$$\nsuite_since=\"$(date -u +%FT%TZ)\"\nprintf '{\"agent\":\"codex-root\",\"host\":\"mike-dev\",\"branch\":\"detached:1c43441e\",\"worktree\":\"/home/mike/nexus-wt/eval-agent-toolchain-binds-validation\",\"pid\":%s,\"since\":\"%s\",\"scope\":\"PR318 immutable snapshot focused eval_integrity+eval_hardened; no held-out tasks; release after runner exit\"}\\n' \"$suite_pid\" \"$suite_since\" > \"$suite_claim/owner.json\"\nprintf '%s\\n' \"$(date -u +%FT%TZ) CLAIM SUITE agent=codex-root branch=detached:1c43441e worktree=/home/mike/nexus-wt/eval-agent-toolchain-binds-validation pid=$suite_pid tests=eval_integrity+eval_hardened no_heldout_tasks\" >> \"$claims_dir/../nexus-claims.log\"\ntemp_dir=\"$(mktemp -d /home/mike/nexus-wt/pr318-test-tmp.XXXXXX)\"\nTMPDIR=\"$temp_dir\" node cli/scripts/run_tests.mjs test/eval_integrity.test.ts test/eval_hardened.test.ts\ntest_result=$?\nprintf '%s\\n' \"$(date -u +%FT%TZ) RELEASE SUITE agent=codex-root worktree=/home/mike/nexus-wt/eval-agent-toolchain-binds-validation revision=1c43441e result=$test_result tests=eval_integrity+eval_hardened isolated_HOME no_heldout_tasks\" >> \"$claims_dir/../nexus-claims.log\"\nrm \"$suite_claim/owner.json\"\nrmdir \"$suite_claim\"\npython3 -c 'import shutil,sys; shutil.rmtree(sys.argv[1])' \"$temp_dir\"\nexit \"$test_result\""}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"failed","aggregated_output":"✔ runAsAclArgs scopes evaluator and operator permissions with directory defaults (26.386836ms)\n✔ asUserSpec preserves timeout metadata and isolated processes reject missing timeouts (21.854273ms)\n✔ test infrastructure is recognised across Python, Go, JS/TS and Rust layouts (14.378875ms)\n✔ hidden test staging preserves workspace files and mounts only copied hidden files (12.0695ms)\n✔ Python oracle preload keeps saved source out of module globals and sys.path (82.769595ms)\n✔ pytest candidate imports cannot inspect hidden Python sources (9307.044167ms)\n✔ Rust and Go compile-time file inclusion directives refuse hardened checks (6.224435ms)\n✔ only the agent's source changes reach the fresh check workspace; adversarial workspace state never does (10.644135ms)\n✔ manifest changes outside plain dependency and metadata edits refuse the checks (2.638721ms)\n✔ a heldout-v2 manifest binds each selected task's task.json and hidden directory (15.361404ms)\n✖ hardened checks: a correct change passes in a fresh workspace; a test-script change refuses the checks (250.573482ms)\n✖ hardened checks hide oracle source from candidate code and reject empty-output commands (270.011962ms)\n✔ test data, symlinked paths, new Python packages, oversized files and manifest deletions never weaken the checks (23.982813ms)\n✔ Rust and Go compile-time file inclusion directives refuse hardened checks (4.739151ms)\n✔ Go and Rust hidden sources are absent during build audits and test execution (45071.573421ms)\n✔ manifest guards fail closed on TOML headers they do not recognise, go.mod blocks and new manifests (6.380347ms)\n✔ the model proxy forwards requests and counts answers and upstream failures (141.941324ms)\n✔ the evaluation proxy authenticates the local run token and replaces it with the upstream credential (22.595394ms)\n✔ the evaluation proxy bounds request count and body size (14.415835ms)\n✔ the evaluation proxy bounds concurrent inference and cancels upstream work on client abort (27.516339ms)\n✔ the evaluation proxy enforces per-request and aggregate requested completion-token ceilings (25.90071ms)\n✔ the evaluation proxy never forwards the local token when the upstream is unauthenticated (9.721919ms)\n✔ infrastructure reruns use one rule for every agent: a crash after the model answered is scored (149.975341ms)\n✔ contaminated runs leave the pass rate, crashes are counted, and reruns are listed (77.920992ms)\n✔ T4 scoring requires all nine classes and five injected runs per class (620.967756ms)\n✔ task validation: pinned repos, one source, and black-box hidden oracle for qualification (38.626237ms)\n✔ T4 fixture evidence requires an exact CLI runner receipt and measured storage boundary (9.317544ms)\n✔ black-box oracle keeps canary expectations outside the candidate process and returns sanitized evidence (400.348674ms)\n✔ Python black-box oracle uses only pinned offline Go and Rust toolchains, or fails preflight (8422.066948ms)\n✔ a qualification run is refused without a model fingerprint (weights, server build, sampling) (1.457255ms)\n✔ qualification requires frozen request and aggregate output budgets (0.903479ms)\n✔ hidden tests must be unreadable to the agent's own user (2.125236ms)\n✔ candidate agents receive only the approved read-only Go and Rust toolchain mounts (1.125046ms)\n✖ qualification runtime mounts cannot overlap the task tree, held-out store, or private validator paths (3754.824002ms)\n✔ qualification remains fail-closed without enforced aggregate resource controls (6.560277ms)\n✔ resource contract: candidate memory, processes, storage and CPU are kernel-bounded and every process is reaped (44519.953698ms)\n✔ resource supervisor preserves SIGTERM grace for descendants after the main payload exits (2572.147152ms)\n✔ candidate sandbox and resource supervisor compose around a staged repository (7100.067739ms)\n✔ repository workspaces carry no history beyond the pinned baseline commit (5712.927389ms)\n✔ task paths reject traversal, symlink escapes, and unstable task trees (6.423621ms)\n✔ task-tree digests frame paths, entry types, executable mode, and content lengths (24.619305ms)\n✔ task setup and validators run with cleared env, no network, confined filesystem, bounded output and timeout (24293.694828ms)\n✔ candidate namespace cannot read host files or bypass pinned compilers with absolute paths (5197.395685ms)\n✔ qualification corpus binding rejects missing, mismatched, and post-seal task content (7.819289ms)\n✔ run.mjs refuses to start on an invalid task (231.403611ms)\n✔ the model prox